0.288 [TeamEurope]

Vibes Retro Pocket Gamer 240-in-1 (set 2), <unknown>, 202?

The "Vibes Retro Pocket Gamer 240-in-1" is an affordable standalone handheld console, sold as a nostalgic gadget primarily in B&M Retail stores in the UK and marketed by various European brands (such as Silvergear or QSS) using the same basic hardware. The device is a typical pocket-sized clone (Famiclone) designed to replicate the classic visual and aesthetic style of 8-bit handheld systems from the 1990s.

