$info=110dance
$mame
0.219 [Team Europe, David Haywood]

Retro Dance Mat (110 song Super StepMania + 9-in-1 games) (PAL), <unknown>, 200?

Whether young or old, everyone loves to swing the dance leg on this mat. Choose from 10 different characters, 9 scenes and dance on 110 different songs of different genres. Choose your favourite song and play the arrow combinations on screen on the mat by touching the corresponding arrow with your foot at the right time. Play with your friends and compete with your best scores (source: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Orb-Gaming-Retro-Dance-Gold-Red/dp/B07H5TTM3X).

