$info=168pcase
$mame
0.278 [TeamEurope]

Diier-D-10 168-in-1 phone case, <unknown>, 202?

This is a smartphone accessory that combines a protective case with a built-in mini retro console, featuring 168 pre-installed games. Designed as a fun and practical gadget, the case includes a small display and physical controls (joystick and buttons) for playing directly on the back of your phone. Perfect for retro gaming enthusiasts, it lets you enjoy arcade-style and 8-bit titles anytime—no need to use your phone’s app. Blending device protection with portable entertainment, it delivers a nostalgic gaming experience in an original, pocket-sized format.

