$info=265games
$mame
0.271 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

265-in-1 Handheld Game (SPG2xx based), <unknown>, 201?

This is a portable console with a built-in display, powered by the SPG2xx chipset, and comes loaded with an extensive collection of 265 preinstalled games—mostly clones and simplified versions of classic arcade titles and retro classics. Designed for immediate, standalone use, it features physical controls like a joystick and buttons, and operates on either batteries or USB power. Thanks to its compact form factor and minimalist design, it’s perfect for gaming on the go—and ideal for anyone seeking affordable, nostalgic entertainment. Typical of budget-friendly mini-consoles, it delivers a straightforward, no-frills gaming experience aimed at enthusiasts who enjoy casual, accessible retro gaming in an informal setting.

