36-in-1 Classic Games phone case, <unknown>, 202?

This is a smartphone case that integrates a mini retro console with 36 classic games pre-installed. Featuring a small screen and physical controls—such as a joystick and buttons—on the back, it lets you play directly on the case without needing to use your phone’s app. Designed for portable, instant entertainment, it combines the protective function of a phone case with the playful appeal of a pocket-sized gaming console. Perfect for fans of vintage games, it delivers a nostalgic yet casual gaming experience, turning your device into a fun and uniquely multifunctional gadget.

