3B2/310, AT&T, 1985

Within the AT&T 3B2 Line, the 3B2/310 is the entry level system capable of supporting up to 14 simultaneously active users. It includes a diskette drive for removable data storage, a hard disk for high capacity fixed storage and an optional tape back-up unit for high capacity removable data storage. The 3B2/310 can be configured with up to 32 serial connections, a Mathematical Accelerator Unit and an SCSI interface (source: original brochure).

