0.168 [David Haywood]

Atari 2600 ROM Cart HARMONY/MELODY, <unknown>, ????

The Harmony cart is a 'modern' A2600 cartridge, used for homebrew etc. It has an SD slot and can be connected to a PC, roms can be transferred to it with software on the PC side. It uses an ARM7TDMI-S LPC2103 @ 70 Mhz to emulate the mapper behavior of other cartridges. It has an SD card slot for storing game data.

