$info=a800_rtime8
$mame
0.247 [AJR]

ICD R-Time 8, <unknown>, ????

The circuitry in this clock cartridge is very simple, containing the RTC itself, oscillator and battery, and a 74HCT138 to decode the $D5B8-$D5BF address range from the /CCTL and A7-A3 pins. No ROM is included; however, the cartridge can be placed in the (currently unemulated) passthrough slot of the SpartaDOS X cartridge.

DRIVER:
devices/bus/a800/rtime8.cpp

DRIVER STATUS:
Emulation: Good
Color: Good
Sound: Good
Graphics: Good
Save State: Unsupported

WIP:
- 0.247: AJR added 'ICD R-Time 8' device.

ROMSET:
None required.

$end
