- 0.141: Added Color version ROMs [Ola Andersson].
- 0.140: Added a new revision of the floppy controller ROM. Added a dump of the keyboard controller ROM [exon, Curt Coder]. Emulated the built-in keyboard; emulated the "fast" floppy disk controller. Note that only raw sector dumps work currently (td0 not supported) [Curt Coder, exon]; refactored drivers to define ADDRESS_MAP_MODERN. [Curt Coder
- 0.102: Fixed crash (bug #763) [Nate Woods].
- 0.93: Curt Coder added 'Luxor Datorer AB ABC 800 C/HR' system.

