0.219 [Team Europe, David Haywood]

Wikid Joystick 14-in-1, Advance Bright Ltd. / JungleTac, 200?

The SH6578 is a famiclone with 16 colour tiles, and an attribute entry for every tile (rather than every 2x2 block of tiles)  Not all games currently work (DMA issues etc. possibly using the wrong trigger/enable mechanism at the moment) however some work well enough to demonstrate here. This is an interesting platform as it isn't directly compatible with the NES, all games require modification to run on it due to the different VRAM layout (source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TmdrtcvuvyI).

