$info=aceex2814
$mame
0.179 [Joakim Larsson Edström]

Aceex 2814, Aceex Corporation, 1995

The Aceex 2814 is a communications device, probably a fax/data modem, manufactured by the Taiwanese company Aceex Technology Corporation . Aceex was known in the 1990s for producing a wide range of connectivity devices, including serial modems, network cards, and adapters for transmitting data over telephone lines. The model number "2814" suggests that this is a modem compatible with the V.28 or V.34 standard, used for data and fax transmission over analog telephone lines. The following are some probable characteristics and details based on the historical and technological context.

