$info=adds2020
$mame
0.240 [Bitsavers]

ADDS 2020, Applied Digital Data Systems, 1986

The Applied Digital Data Systems ADDS 2020 (often referred to as ADDS 2020 ) is a hardware device related to the field of video terminals and graphics workstations, manufactured by Applied Digital Data Systems (ADDS), a company active in the 1970s, 1980s, and 1990s in the field of intelligent terminals, CAD systems, and dedicated workstations. The company was known for producing alphanumeric terminals, graphics terminals, and dedicated computers for the business, engineering, and government sectors. The ADDS 2020 is part of this product range, and is among the devices used in the professional field.

