Atari Flashback Portable (version 4), AtGames, 2019

The Atari Flashback Portable is a handheld console produced by Atari, launched to celebrate and bring back the classic games of the golden age of video games. It is a retro device inspired by the original Atari 2600 and Atari 7800 consoles, but designed to be compact and easy to carry.

