$info=amaztron
$mame
0.157 [hap, Sean Riddle]

Amaze-A-Tron, Coleco, 1978

1979 Maze game with 8 variations including a two player mode. The play pieces are kept within a seperate battery compartment in the base. Immaculate example of this very old electronic game. Full tested in Brand New condition. Includes both battery covers, and play pieces. Also included is the original box, original manual, trouble shooting guide, and very rare Colour Coleco catalogue. The catalogue includes pictures and details of the rare Telstar Combat and Telstar Arcade consoles (source: http://www.retrogames.co.uk/003270/Handheld/Amaze-A-Tron-by-Coleco-Boxed).

DRIVER:
