WIP:
- 0.288: Debugger improvements (#15313): Add/correct a few dasm symbols; add dasm for some missing opcodes; complete the simple modes: fix typos, normalize whitespace; direct page, absolute, absolute long; add missing C06D TESTREG, C08B LCBANK1; also skip FPI sync for fast registers, per GS Hardware Ref; perf: skip slow JSL dasm indirection; perf: binary search dasm symbols [arekkusu42].
- 0.258: Display bank number in system calls [Peter Ferrie].
- 0.235: Added disassembler support for GS/OS and ProDOS 16 calls [Kelvin Sherlock].
- 0.207: R. Belmont added 'Apple II Common Components' device.

