0.277 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Millennium Arcade 3D 15-in-1, Millennium 2000 GmbH / JungleTac, 200?

It's a dedicated game console, produced as part of the category of so-called "TV plug-and-play game systems", which are inexpensive, self-contained devices that connect directly to the television to play a variety of pre-installed games without the need for a computer or modern console. This particular unit was produced by Millennium 2000 GmbH, in collaboration with JungleTac, two companies known for launching a number of "retro" or arcade classic-inspired devices on the European market (especially in the late 1990s and early 2000s).

