0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

AR Dance Mat (Model DM02, YRPRSODF), Shen Zhen Shi Fei Xun Hu Dong Technology, 202?

Interactive motion-play mat based on augmented reality technology, transforming the floor into a responsive play surface. Designed to engage children and families in fun, stimulating physical activities, it detects footsteps and foot movements via sensors, syncing them with animations and commands displayed on an external screen. Includes both educational and recreational game modes, featuring visual and audio feedback to encourage coordination, rhythm, and active learning. Ideal for home use, it promotes dynamic play without the need for handheld controllers.

