$info=atm18mcc
$mame
0.246 [hap]

ATM18 Mini Chess Computer (English), Elektor, 2009

The Elektor ATM18 system can be used to make a surprisingly simple and effective chess computer. The only additional hardware required is a few low-cost pushbuttons. The software for the project is written in C, and it was far from an easy task to fit the program in the 8 KB of program memory offered by the ATmega88 (source: https://www.elektormagazine.com/magazine/elektor-200909/19174).

