$info=ax20
$mame
0.144u5 [Sandro Ronco]

AX-20, Axel, 1982

The AXEL-20 can display 640x416 pixels with 8 different level of brightness. The system has it own character set (128 ASCII characters, upper and lower case). The user character generator is only optional. In fact many features are optional; real-time clock, disk-drive, expansion bus, V24 card, modem, graphic card. The AXEL-20 is not IBM PC compatible at all. It can only read IBM disks with a special software tool (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?st=1&c=557).

