Vending machine model T12, Azkoyen, 19??

The Azkoyen Vending Machine Model T12 is an automated dispenser produced by Azkoyen, a Spanish company specialized in vending solutions. Designed for dispensing hot and cold beverages as well as snacks, the T12 stands out for its compactness, reliability, and intuitive user interface. Equipped with an electronic control system, it supports various payment methods, including coins, bills, and cashless options (such as contactless cards or mobile payments). Built with durable materials, it is suitable for indoor settings like offices, schools, and common areas. The T12 also offers remote diagnostic features and product-level monitoring, simplifying management and maintenance for operators.

