$info=batvgc
$mame
0.264 [David Haywood, Sean Riddle]

Interactive M.A.G. Motion Activated Gear: The Batman - Villains of Gotham City, Thinkway Toys, 200?

Various interactive devices (gloves, bat-boomerang, etc.), inspired by the world of Batman, react to the player’s movements to trigger sounds, iconic phrases, and light effects. Designed to simulate the experience of a hero facing Gotham’s villains, it recognizes gestures like punches, shields, or throws, activating immersive gameplay modes with missions, challenges, and context-specific feedback. Crafted from durable materials and featuring an ergonomic design, it encourages active and dynamic role-playing—without the need for a screen or external connections. Perfectly suited for kids and fans alike, this innovative toy combines motion-sensing technology with theatrical storytelling, embodying the essence of today’s modern action-based playthings.

