$info=bay1000c
$mame
0.218 [rfka01]

BAY-1000C V1.01, Mintek, 198?

Portable media player with DVD functionality and support for common video/audio formats, designed for use on the go or in home environments. Equipped with a built-in 10-inch LCD screen, stereo speakers, USB/SD inputs, and AV output for connecting to an external TV. Includes a remote control, rechargeable battery, and compatibility with subtitles and multilingual menus. Compact design with a built-in handle for easy transport, perfect for travel, home entertainment, or secondary use. Offers a simple plug-and-play experience—no installation required—ideal for watching movies, cartoons, or educational content stored on physical media.

