$info=cb308
$mame
0.152 [Robbbert]

CB-308, Cromemco, 1977

Expandable peripheral system for 8-bit computers, designed for advanced professional and hobbyist use. It features slots for additional cards, serial and parallel interfaces, integrated power supply, and compatibility with S-100 architectures. Ideal for software development, industrial control, or custom applications from the 1970s–1980s.

