$info=cdkong
$mame
0.160 [hap, Kevin Horton, Olivier Galibert]

Donkey Kong (Coleco), Coleco, 1982

One of the cool, arcade game shaped handhelds, based on Nintendo's Donkey Kong arcade game. These are much-desired collectibles, and aren't always easy to find in really good condition. They each (Frogger, Donkey Kong, Galaxian, Pac Man, Ms Pac Man) have a sticker on the top of the game, front, left side and right side, as well as a plastic sticker on the control panel. One or more of these is frequently damaged or missing. There is also an instruction sticker on the bottom of each of them. They should also have an egg-shaped knob on the end of each joystick (this was only held on with a screw, and was also subject to disappearing.) An original price: $54.95 (source: http://www.handheldmuseum.com/Coleco/DK.htm).

