- 0.252: Cleaned up descriptions in software list [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.249: Replaced abbreviated country names with full names and added 'language info elements in 'cdtv.xml' [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.154: Dirk Best Changed description from 'CDTV (NTSC)' to 'CDTV (PAL)' and year of production (1990).
- 0.135: Added 'workaround for crash due to CDDA failing initialization (more work needed to properly fix this) and fixed CIA0 problem which was crashing MESS with some games (e.g. Turrican) [Fabio Priuli].
- 0.126: Fixed a couple of regressions introduced in 0.125. Still CDTV regression is not fixed [Fabio Priuli].
- 0.118: Added 'NVRAM support [Ernesto Corvi].
- 0.106: Dirk Best added 'CBM CDTV (NTSC)' system.

