Advanced version of a medical device for computerized perimetry, optimized for the early detection and monitoring of visual field defects. It integrates rapid screening algorithms, features a simplified interface for the operator, and offers enhanced sensitivity in peripheral mapping. Designed for dynamic clinical settings, it supports the diagnosis of conditions such as glaucoma more efficiently than basic models—while still maintaining compatibility with standardized protocols.

