$info=cfx9850gb
$mame
0.264 [QUFB]

CFX-9850GB Plus, Casio, 1996

The Casio CFX-9850GC Plus calculator is a graphing-type desktop device weighing 215 grams. It supports up to 5 batteries, consisting of AAA and CR2032. The calculator is controlled by buttons and does not have a tilting or backlit display. The main display has a capacity of 21 characters by 8 lines and does not have a second display.  The Casio CFX-9850GC Plus is capable of performing a wide range of mathematical operations, as well as having some useful features such as the ability to create graphs and tables. The calculator is designed to be accurate and efficient, making it an excellent choice for students, teachers, and professionals working in the scientific and technical fields (source, translated from Italian: https://www.manualeduso.it/casio/cfx-9850gc-plus/manuale).

