- 0.177: Ryan Holtz added 'Fairlight CMI IIx' system. Fairlight CMI IIx driver: Modernization of Phil's CMI IIx driver. Hooked up serial callbacks, alphanumeric keyboard now works. Fixed FDC DMA, QDOS now boots. Fixed MSM5832 RTC hookup. Hook up second floppy [Ryan Holtz].

