Cobra 80K (ITCI), ITCI, 1988

Monochromatic serial terminal with a 12-inch CRT display, designed for professional and industrial environments of the 1980s. It supports emulation of standard terminals (such as VT100), features RS-232 connectivity, and includes an integrated keyboard with a functional layout. Robust construction makes it suitable for heavy-duty use in mainframe systems, automation, or process control applications. Ideal for retrofits, legacy lab setups, or preserving historical systems.

