Manufactured and distributed in 1985 by Daewoo in Korea, this game console is compatible with MSX1 software cartridge. There were two models. The first CPC-50A, is white and pink or white and green. There are two different circuit boards. The second model, the CPC-50B, available in two color choices too, blue and yellow or pink and blue sky. Power has been simplified and Zemmix is written in Korean characters on top (source traslated from French: http://www.msxvillage.fr/wiki/wiki.php?title=zemmix-cpc-50#paragraph_description).

