Zemmix CPC-51 (MSX1, Korea), Daewoo, 1988

Zemmix, trade mark and brand name of South Korean electronics company Daewoo Electronics Co., Ltd., is an MSX-based video game console brand. The brand name Zemmix is no longer in use. Under the name Zemmix, Daewoo released a series of gaming console compatible with the MSX home computer standards. The consoles were in production between 1985 and 1995. The consoles were not sold outside South Korea (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zemmix).

