- 0.243: Fix crash with no GD-ROM loaded [AJR].
- 0.199: Made GD_LEND return bytes transferred by DMA rather than bytes remaining - allows Daytona USA 2001 to boot [snickerbockers].
- 0.197: Fixed interface/name/diskarea so discs can actually boot in dc.xml [Justin Kerk].
- 0.147u4: Added 'European DC BIOS 1.01c [BadAd84].
- 0.145u5: Fix the maple hookup and controllers and add the missing maple irq [Olivier Galibert].
- 0.134: Initial support for controllers and GD-ROM drive added. Discs do not boot yet [R. Belmont].
- 0.118: R. Belmont added 'Sega Dreamcast (not working)' system.

