$info=dgun3944
$mame
0.286 [TeamEurope]

My Arcade All Star Sports (Pixel Pocket, DGUNL3944), dreamGEAR, 2021

Portable mini console produced by dreamGEAR under the "My Arcade Pixel Pocket" line (model DGUNL3944), marketed around the 2010–2020 period. This compact device, shaped like a Game Boy and featuring an LCD screen measuring roughly 2–3 inches, is dedicated to a themed collection of classic sports games in an 8-bit/16-bit style. It includes titles inspired by sports such as soccer, basketball, baseball, hockey, and track and field, with simplified pixel-art graphics. The device boasts a pocket-sized design made from colorful plastic (typically red or blue for its sports-themed aesthetic), equipped with directional buttons and two action buttons, and powered by AAA batteries. Aimed at a young, nostalgic audience as an affordable device for casual entertainment, it represents one of many themed variants within dreamGEAR's Pixel Pocket line—specializing in single-theme mini consoles with built-in, unlicensed games.

