Datamax 8000, Datamax, 1981

This computer was designed and made by Datamax Pty Ltd, in Manly, Sydney, Australia. It could have up to 4x 8 inch floppy drives, in the IBM format.
There were a bunch of optional extras such as 256kB RAM, numeric coprocessor, RTC, etc. (source: dmax8000.cpp driver).

