$info=dmbtjunc
$mame
0.274 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

Let's! TV Play Digital Monster Battle Junction (Japan), Bandai, 2006

A portable device inspired by Digimon, designed for a young audience, that blends digital gameplay with TV interactivity. It allows users to collect, raise, and battle virtual creatures, and can connect to a specific TV broadcast signal to unlock exclusive content or participate in synchronized events. Battery-powered, it features a compact design and dedicated buttons for intuitive navigation.

