Galaxian 2 (Entex), Entex, 1981

Entex Galaxian 2, based on Bally/Midway's Galaxian arcade game. Called Galaxian 2 becuase it can be a two-player game (there is no Entex Galaxian). See also Astro Galaxy and Astro Invader, foreign renames of the same game. Holding down the Missile button while turning on the machine will start a graphics test (source: http://www.handheldmuseum.com/Entex/Galaxian2.htm).

