Featuring the ultimate in portability, the e-kara Pro Headset clips to your hip and has a hot sleek design! Makes you look like a star! Features include Tempo (slow the music down or speed it up), Echo (add awesome echo effects), Volume (control the volume of the music), Effects (choose a cool voice effect--Soprano (raises the key of your voice), Bass (lowers the key of your voice), or Vibrato (adds a vibrating effect to your voice)). Song cartridge includes "Fallin'", "Sometimes" and "Everywhere". All music is digitally recorded and not recorded by the original artists (source: https://m.kmart.com/noone-e-kara-real-karaoke-pro-headset-music/p-SPM14378089632).

