0.275 [hap, Milan Galcik, Igor Nys]

Basketbol (Elektronika), Elektronika, 199?

"Elektronika Basketbol" is a portable electronic game produced in the Soviet Union during the 1980s. It is part of the Elektronika family of devices, a series of electronic products developed by Soviet industry for the domestic market. These devices ranged from calculators and digital watches to simple electronic games designed to provide affordable entertainment at a time when Western products were hard to come by.

