The EQU1TY III+ / EPSON PC AX computer system inc1udes two major elements; a main system unit and a keyboard. The EQUITY III+ / EPSON PC AX hardware configuration has Cl high degree of compatibility with the IBM AT and the new AT. System Performance EQUITY 111+ / EPSON PC AX has three CPU execution speeds, these are the IBN AT speed (6 MHz), the new AT speed (8 MHz) and a fast er speed (10 Mhz). Speed is selected by setting a three-position switch easily accessed from the front. The user can see the  selected execution speed by the color of a LED (source: original manual).

