Falcon030, Atari, 1992

The Atari Falcon030 Computer System was Atari Corporation's final computer product. Codenamed Sparrow, the machine was based on a Motorola 68030 main CPU, and had a Motorola 56000 digital signal processor, a feature which distinguished it from most other microcomputers of the era (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atari_Falcon).

