0.132 [Miodrag Milanović]

FK-1, Statni statek Klicany, 1989

This is a generic CP/M computer. Box with two eight-inch drives Consul 7113, 243kB each, on the back of the chassis is bolted flat box with a computer motherboard. Processor U880D (Z80), 25x80 characters in 256x512 grid points, some that memory. The computer has 2KB (but can be configured with up to 16KB) ROM, 64kB RAM and continuous plus a 16KB VideoRam. ROM and VRAM are pages in the lower 32Kb (source, traslated (badly) from czech: https://sites.google.com/site/computerresearchltd/Home/stare-stroje/statni-statek-klicany-fk-1).

