$info=flash
$mame
0.221 [hap, Kevin Horton]

Flash (Ideal), Ideal Toy Corporation, 1980

It is a portable electronic game released in 1980, based on the "Simon Says" gameplay format. Featuring four colored buttons with integrated lights, it challenges players to repeat increasingly long sequences of sounds and illuminated patterns. Designed for an immediate and competitive gaming experience, it stimulates memory and coordination in a compact, battery-powered form. It has become a classic of 1980s electronic games.

