$info=fm7
$mame
0.139 [Barry Rodewald]

FM-7, Fujitsu, 1982

FM-7 (Fujitsu Micro 7) is a home computer released in 1982 in Japan. The Fujitsu FM-7 was Fujitsu's first entry into the Japanese home computer market, and for their debut computer, they chose to come out with a 6809-based personal computer very similar to Radio Shack's Color Computer (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FM-7).

