0.155 [Porchy]

GameKing GM-218, TimeTop, 2003

GameKing is a brand of handheld game consoles, designed and developed by TimeTop in 2003, for the Hong Kong consumer market. The brand has three consoles, the GameKing I, the GameKing II and the GameKing III. A fourth console, the Handy Game, was produced by Timetop and shares some branding, but otherwise has little to do with the GameKing franchise (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GameKing).

