Play Portable Color GameU+ (108-in-1) (Japan), YSN, 201?

It’s a handheld console featuring a color LCD screen and 108 preinstalled games, primarily simplified clones of arcade titles and 8-bit console classics. It comes with a built-in controller equipped with directional and action buttons, battery-powered operation, and a built-in speaker. The device does not support game cartridges or software updates, offering an instant and nostalgic gaming experience for casual users. Designed for on-the-go fun, it combines compactness with a diverse selection of content and was released in Japan with a design tailored to the local market.

