$info=gsp5
$mame
0.249 [DBWBP]

GSP 5 Guitar Effects Processor/Preamp, DigiTech, 1989

Digitech GSP5 multi effect rack unit. It can run up to 5 effects simultaneously. The effects include: distortion, reverb, delay, chorus, flange, eq and, according to the manual, "other special effects". This one space rack unit would be great for a guitarist or keyboard player that likes to save custom sounds and use midi to link several effect units together. This particular item is from 1990, and the presets are reflective of the era. There is a programmable function as well, so the user can save custom sounds. The foot switch is included. There are midi in and midi through jacks on the back, as well as stereo outputs and two foot switch jacks (source: https://reverb.com/item/1069664-digitech-gsp-5-multi-effect-rack-unit).

DRIVER:
