$info=icb_car
$mame
0.274 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Interactive Coloring Book: Disney / Pixar Cars, Techno Source, 200?

An electronic device for children released by Techno Source in 2006, inspired by the Disney/Pixar film Cars. This portable tablet features a 4-inch monochromatic LCD touchscreen and a stylus pen for digitally coloring scenes and characters from the franchise (Lightning McQueen, Mack, Sally). It comes preloaded with various images, color palettes that can be selected using dedicated buttons, and an "undo" function to correct mistakes. Powered by AA batteries, it’s designed for creative use at home or on the go without the need for external connections. Targeted at children aged 4 to 8, it serves as a digital alternative to traditional coloring books, boasting a durable design and a simplified interface for independent use.

