$info=innotv
$mame
0.227 [Team Europe]

InnoTV, VTech, 2015

Play and learn with the InnoTV educational gaming system by VTech! Perfect for preschoolers, InnoTV is an educational TV-connected system with an easy-to-use wireless controller. InnoTV comes with four fun learning games that introduce language arts, math, science and more, including two multiplayer games that are fun for the whole family. The controller is perfectly sized for small hands and features a joystick, smart wheel and motion control so your child can tilt and shake it to play select games. You can also use your smartphone or tablet to personalise your child's profile, play multiplayer games and customise the learning content in certain games. Expand the fun and download additional games from Learning Lodge or buy select cartridges from our InnoTab library. For ages three and up (source: https://www.thetoyshop.com/baby-pre-school/electronic-learning/VTech-InnoTV-Games-System/p/528556).

