- 0.157: Added keyboard  proms and readme information from initial ROM package [Tafoid].
- 0.136: Fixed intvkbd. Fixed disassembler [Robbbert].
- 0.37b15: Frank Palazzolo added 'Intellivision Kbd Component preliminary' system.

