0.152 [Team Europe]

IQ Unlimited, VTech / Integrated Systems Inc., 1995

While Vtech states that the I.Q. Unlimited Computer is "for ages 9 and up," this is no "toy." It is a real computer with a Z80 CPU. The I.Q. Unlimited Computer is pre-loaded with 11 programs and a BASIC interpreter for programming. Essentially, this is an integrated suite. The software titles included (listed in the order they appear in the main menu screen) are: Word processor, Spell Review (spell Right), Calculator, Mind challenge, Word Zappers, Basic Tutor, Basic, 200 Year calendar, Spreadsheet, Graphs, Database and Art studio (source: http://www.danielsays.com/ss-gallery-vtech-iq-unlimited.html).

