$info=itvg48
$mame
0.219 [Team Europe, David Haywood]

Interactive TV Games 48-in-1 (PAL), TaiKee, 200?

Affordable TaiKee console TV game (Asian OEM brand) with 48 built-in games. Compact design featuring two wired controllers integrated into the chassis; PAL video output for European TVs; power supplied via an external adapter. The games are simplified clones of classic arcade/8-bit titles (platformers, shooters, puzzles) with reduced 2D graphics and basic audio. No official licenses: titles have modified names to avoid copyright issues. Intended for discount markets as an entry-level entertainment option for children and families. Typical Chinese production for European retailers from 2005 to 2015, offering an affordable solution for casual gaming on traditional TVs.

