Wheel of Fortune (JAKKS Pacific TV Game, Game-Key Ready) (Jul 11 2005 ORIG), JAKKS Pacific Inc / HotGen Ltd, 2005

Wheel of Fortune is a TV game based upon the hit game show Wheel of Fortune. It was released in 2005 by Jakks Pacific. The game is just Wheel of Fortune but it features a spinning wheel. You can either spin with the wheel or press B for a random spin. There were 3 types of difficulty: Easy(6 Turns), Normal(5 Turns), and Hard(4 Turns). The game featured 3 Modes: 1. Gameshow (Standard Show with the amount of turns refilling every puzzle) 2. Endurance (Similar to Gameshow, except that every puzzle, the turns do not get refilled. The Run ends when you lose all turns) 3. Multiplayer (2-Player or 3-Player with a spin-off to start it. Whenever a player guesses a letter wrong or Lands on Lose a Turn or Bankrupt, the next player gets the turn. Highest amount goes to play for the Bonus Puzzle). The game has 720 puzzles each in 35 categories (source: https://plugplaytvgames.fandom.com/wiki/Wheel_of_Fortune).

