0.288 [TeamEurope]

Double Dance Mat with HDMI (Kaximon), Kaximon, 202?

The "Kaximon Double Dance Mat with HDMI" is a modern, all-in-one Plug & Play gaming and fitness system designed to connect directly to a TV. This device represents a contemporary evolution of that concept: while it operates independently without the need for a console (like the old Konami dance mat), it uses 720p HD HDMI connectivity to work with modern televisions. Furthermore, the internal hardware of this Kaximon model has also been officially added to the emulator’s preservation database.

