Kunio-kun TV (5-in-1), Lithon, 2021

Plug-and-play console designed to connect directly to your TV, featuring a beloved series of Japanese arcade games and consoles from the 1980s—complete with five pre-installed titles inspired by the adventures of the rebellious protagonist. Offering simple, straightforward gameplay, it comes with integrated controls on the dedicated pad, pixel-art graphics that stay true to the originals, and retro-inspired soundscapes. Perfect for fans of the series and retro gaming enthusiasts, this console includes features like level selection and save progress functionality. With its compact design, standard AV connectivity, and power supplied via an adapter, it’s ideal for reliving the nostalgic atmosphere of classic urban fighting games and role-playing titles—all without any complicated setup.

