$info=ltleappad
$mame
0.218 [Sean Riddle, Clawgrip]

Little Touch LeapPad, LeapFrog, 2005

Leap Frog Little Touch LeapPad is designed for reading together with toddler and then for the toddler's independent years to use alone. Case requires 4 AA batteries; not included. Accessories included are:One Bear in the Bedroom book introduces numbers, counting, shapes and animals. Lulu the Letter Spinning Spider book/cartridge discovers letters and letter sounds. Guess How Much I Love You book/cartridge discovers music and instruments. If I Were book/cartridge discovers colors Pooh Loves You book/cartridge discovers friendship and emotions. Animal Dance book/cartridge discovers rhythms and dance. Animal World book/cartridge discovers animals and animal attributes. A to Z Adventures book/cartridge discovers letters and letter sounds Let's Get Busy, Baby! book/cartridge discovers first words in English and Spanish. Rainbow Fish book/cartridge introduces numbers, counting, colors, music and rhythm. Let's Get Moving Puzzle includes interactive puzzle, cartridge and instruction guideLeapPad is in excellent condition and works perfectly; sounds are clear and volume loud (source: https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/leap-frog-little-touch-leappad-10-1828285586).

