0.286 [TeamEurope]

Power Console (JCG100i1, English/French), Lexibook, 2020

Economical console TV game manufactured by Lexibook (a French brand specializing in educational devices), model JCG100i1. Compact device with built-in games running on simplified hardware (ARM chipset or unofficial retro clones), featuring a colorful plastic design and two integrated wired controllers. Includes composite video/HDMI output for TVs, powered via an external adapter. Comes with simplified casual games (platformers, puzzles, sports) featuring reduced 2D graphics and basic audio. Multilingual interface—English and French selectable from the menu. No official licenses: titles have slightly modified names to avoid copyright issues. Designed for children and discount markets as entry-level entertainment, typical OEM production from Asia for European brands. Marketed in Europe between 2010 and 2020.

