- 0.285: Fix crash when trying to set PC from debugger [AJR].
- 0.256: Implement as a 68000 variant m68000mcu: Extract from m68000 [Olivier Galibert].
- 0.196: Changed description to 'Motorola MC68008' [Angelo Salese].
- 0.149u1: Added 'M68008' device.

