$info=m6805evs
$mame
0.153 [Al Kossow, Robbbert]

M68HC05EVS, Motorola, 1990

The M68HC05EVS is an economical two-board emulator for M68HC05 microcontroller units (MCUs); connected to your target system, it acts just like the actual (or eventual) target system MCU. The emulator's ease of reprogramming makes the design, debug and evaluation of your target system highly efficient. Note that the EVS does not support programming of OTP (one time programmable) devices (source: http://bitsavers.trailing-edge.com/pdf/motorola/6805/M68HC05EVS/).

DRIVER:
motorola/m6805evs.cpp

DRIVER STATUS:
Emulation: Preliminary
Color: Good
Sound: Good
Graphics: Good
Save State: Unsupported

