$info=mb87013
$mame
0.231 [AJR]

Roland MB87013 QDC, <unknown>, ????

Roland MB87013 QD (Quick Disk) Drive Interface Adapter. This device uses a MB89251 (Intel 8251 compatible USART) to serialize and deserialize the disk data. The two ICs appear to be clocked at the same 6.5 MHz rate, and they have  adress, data, RD and WR signals in common. The OP4 and RTS pins are usually bridged.

