$info=mbaskb
$mame
0.229 [hap, Sean Riddle]

Basketball (Mattel), Mattel Electronics, 1978

This is a very simple but deceptively addictive quick moving game. You're on offense against 5 computer defenders, move around the half court and find an opening and shoot. You can play the Home team against a friend playing the Visitor team or you can play both sides. The game ends after 4 quarters. The game is surprisingly addictive and includes 2 difficulty levels. Really neat is the game display housing, it's shaped like a half basketball court (source: http://herculesworkshop.com/cgi-bin/p/awtp-product.cgi?d=hercules-workshop&item=81370).

