$info=mbdtower
$mame
0.160 [hap, Sean Riddle]

Dark Tower (Milton Bradley), Milton Bradley, 1981

Dark Tower was an innovative hybrid of a role playing game and board game using a fusion of computerized electronic parts in a traditional board game setting. It was released by Milton Bradley in 1981. This game capitalized on both the D&D role playing craze and the video game explosion in the late 1970's and early 1980's (source: http://www.geekvintage.com/milton-bradley-dark-tower.php).

