$info=mc_tv200
$mame
0.195 [David Shah]

200 in 1 Retro TV Game, Thumbs Up, 201?

Plug and play your way back to the future with the Retro TV Games Controller. This handheld controller looks and feels like the gaming controllers we adored in the 80s, yet plugs straight into your modern TV for a gaming experience we could only dream of back then. Compact and ultra-portable, this retro controller is perfect for the whole family. You will get lost in endless hours of action and fun, playing a range of shooting, arcade, puzzle and sports based games. Plug the Retro TV Games Controller into your television and get your fingers at the ready with its integrated mini joystick and A, B buttons. Once plugged in you're all set for a nostalgic gaming session with the 200 strong, on-board retro gaming library (source: https://www.thumbsupuk.com/Products/Retro_TV_Games).

