$info=mc50mk2
$mame
0.221 [DBWBP]

MC-50mkII Micro Composer, Roland, 1992

The MC-50mkII was equipped with slightly advanced features for editing and general use. The MC-50 mk II can directly convert MRC files to MID and MID back to MRC while saving MID files on a DD 720 Kb diskette. For the MC-50 you need special conversion software to do this: the (free) Roland MRM-500 program. A Roland dealer could also upgrade a MC-50 towards a mkII with a special ROM containing that MRM-500 software (source: https://equipboard.com/items/roland-mc-50mkii#description).

DRIVER:
