WIP:
- 0.280: Fix tx disable bug [Patrick Mackinlay].
- 0.279: Remove "Device" from device string [Naoki Saito].
- 0.278: Ignore tx enable if already enabled [Patrick Mackinlay].
- 0.274: Small cleanup [hap].
