- 0.256: Separate transmitter holding and shift registers [Patrick Mackinlay]. Delay setting of TxRDY until start bit time has passed (fixes DUART test on att630) [AJR].
- 0.233: Wait until transmitter is actually empty to set TxEMT [AJR, Bitsavers].
