- 0.218: Re-wrote USART emulation. Added support for 16x clock pre-scaler and data transition synchronization. Implemented break generation and detection, internal loop-back, and synchronous mode. Adjusted clocks in harriet.cpp and machine/x68k_kbd.cpp to to match MFP-generated Baud rates. Serial terminal for tti (tti.cpp) actually works now [AJR].
- 0.206: Implemented parity and framing error checks/status [AJR].
- 0.192: Improved USART behavior for polled operation [AJR].
- 0.191: Fixed TCDCR register - bits 6-4 are used for timer C bits 2-0 are used for timer D [Nicolas PLANEL].
