The MGA Entertainment Miuchiz Pawz Spike, released in 2006, is an interactive electronic toy produced by MGA Entertainment, an American company known for popular franchises like Bratz, L.O.L. Surprise!, and Rainbow High. The device belongs to the Miuchiz Pawz line, a series of electronic virtual animals that combine aspects of digital puppies, portable gadgets, and collectible toys, primarily designed for girls and pre-teenagers.

