16384 bytes in 5 files / 9.91Kb packed

$end
$info=md3
$mame
0.136 [Miodrag Milanović]

Micro Decision MD-3, Morrow Designs, 1982

It is actually the same case and mainboard as the MD-2, only the drives have been replaced with two 1/2 height double sided drives, and a filler plate has been added 'to cover the other drive opening. Also note the front panel 'badge' is changed. Also shown is a Morrow OEM Freedom-100 terminal by Liberty Electronics (source: http://www.classiccmp.org/dunfield/morrow/index.htm).

