- 0.242: Changed descriptive text in descriptions to lowercase in 'megacd.xml' [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.234: Fixed address calculation for main CPU access to PRGRAM [Damian Rogers].
- 0.157: Verified and better documented BIOS of Japanese Rev.E [ShouTime].
- 0.145u4: Two new revision of the megacdj BIOS [El Barto].
- 0.132: David Haywood added skeleton driver of 'Sega Mega-CD (Europe, PAL)' system.

