$info=melodym
$mame
0.183 [hap, Kevin Horton]

Melody Madness, GAF, 1980

Vintage 1980 gaf melody madness game. Electronic musical memory game.melody madness is a musical matching game. Press one of its 24 song buttons and melody madness will play a tune, then give you seven seconds to press another button to match it. If the second button you press is a match, ta-da! Melody madness lights up with a fanfare and you get a point. If not, you get a raspberry. Then the next player take a turn it takes skill and lots of concentration to play (source: http://www.terapeak.com/worth/vintage-1980-gaf-melody-madness-game-electronic-musical-memory-game/182350694881/).

