Encourage and prepare your child for reading and math with this responsive and stimulating toy from LeapFrog. My First LeapPad is a portable learning system with a built-in storybook and magic pen. Kids use the stylus-like pen to touch the book and interact with the stories. Self-directed learning and play lets them hear words, music and sound effects, and sing along to whimsical songs. Interactive games help them explore the alphabet, learn letters and phonics, and develop object, shape and color identification skills. Features 2 play modes, story and activity. Lightweight and easy to carry. Uses 4 AA batteries, included. Imported. 12-1/3Lx12Wx2-4/5D" (source: https://www.amazon.com/LeapFrog-My-First-LeapPad-Blue/dp/B00005BHK6).

