MobiGo 2 (Germany), VTech, 2013

Our child can enjoy on-the-go play with MobiGo 2. This handheld VTech MobiGo 2 Touch Learning System is a multi-functional device that provides fun and education in many different ways. Numerous games and apps on this VTech MobiGo Touch Learning System teach basic learning skills like math, vocabulary, spelling, reading, logic, drawing and more. This VTech MobiGo Learning System provides your child with four ways to interact, including a touchscreen, a QWERTY keyboard, a motion sensor and a microphone. Featuring built-in downloadable apps including eBooks, coloring books, an art studio, a photo album and more, this VTech MobiGo 2 Touch Learning System can give your child hours of fun. This VTech MobiGo Touch Learning System is intended for children ages 3 to 8 years (source: https://www.walmart.com/ip/VTech-MobiGo-2-Touch-Learning-System/21007457).

