Mephisto Monte Carlo has many options, yet still remains a simple to operate chess computer. With it's modern Magnet Sensory Board, your moves are automatically registered as well as the complete board position. You just have to lift your piece and place it down in your desired board location. Wooden magnet sensory board, you just pick up the chess piece and place it on to the square you want to move to. No pressing of board squares required. Mephisto Monte Carlo allows the user to program his own chess openings into the computer with up to 2800 half moves. The chess program is written by Frans Morsch (source: http://www.spacious-mind.com/html/monte_carlo.html).

