$info=ms4144
$mame
0.215 [rfka01]

MS-4144 (SiS 85C496/85C497 chipset), MSI, 199?

The MSI MS-4144 is a very high quality 486 PCI motherboard based on the great SIS496/497 chipset. It also supports the last processors for the base 3 and offers the opportunity to put up to 1MB L2 cache. With the intelligent layout, very long PCI and ISA cards can also be stuck. The BIOS is the Ami Winbios that can be operated with the mouse all settings. LBA support for hard drives is also a matter of course (source, traslated from German: http://www.amoretro.de/2012/07/msi-ms-4144-sis-496497-486-pci-motherboard.html).

