$info=msi_sf2
$mame
0.227 [Team Europe]

Street Fighter II: Special Champion Edition (MSI Plug & Play) (Europe), MSI / Capcom / Sega, 2018

It's interesting looking back at these MSI games to see how many of them were the games of their generation. Space Invaders was a phenomenon in the late 1970s, Double Dragon was the fighting game of the late 1980s and Street Fighter II was the game that, above all else, ate up my funds at a rate of knots in the early 1990s. And it wasn't just me. Nintendo's work in securing it as an early exclusive for the SNES led many (myself included) to buy one just for that game. It's an utterly iconic title, and one that MSI has treated a little differently than its games from prior decades (source: https://www.alexkidman.com/games/msi-street-fighter-ii-tv-plug-play-game-review/).

DRIVER:
sega/megadriv_firecore.cpp

