$info=mt80z
$mame
0.268 [anonymous]

MT-80Z, E&L Instruments, 1982

This comes with a power supply and is tested working. You have peace of mind before you buy it knowing that it will work when you get it. Furthermore, the manual contains 13 experiments which will help you gain programming experience tremendously. Additional projects will build even more confidence in understanding its hardware and software. From Multitech Micro-Professor to E&L Instruments Fox Trainer Micro-Professor is a highly popular Z80 microprocessor learning tool in 1980s. Based on Micro-Professor's original design, E&L instruments went one step further by introducing a Programmable Peripheral Interface (PPI), which is an Intel 8255A chip. The chip together with on-board switches and LEDs greatly enhances its I/O capability and improves student learning experience. E&L products are known for their rugged construction and long durability. That's not all, E&L also provides a huge breadboard area so that an user can create his or her own design and add more capability to this already powerful learning tool. What's Included E&L Instruments MT-80Z Z80 Fox Trainer Power Supply (AC/DC Adapter) eManual (in pdf format) which includes - The major sections of the MT-80Z - Getting Started with the MT-80Z - Experiments: 13 in total - Appendix: 9 in total and MT-80Z (FOX) Schematic and Bill of Materials (BOM) Seller Provided (Seller took a class in 1995 and provided college-level learning tools he collected 20 years ago) Additional Worksheets, Labs and Projects from Ref 2. Test for Sample Case: Pass How Can you Tell? System On: Red LED on, displaying "rEAdy" (Pic 2) User Specified Address: 1830 User Specified Data: 09 System Works: Red LED on, displaying "183009" (Pic 3) Some good references on Z80 include: 1. The Z80 Microprocessor Architecture, Interfacing, Programming & Design. Ramesh S. Gaonkar. 2nd Ed. 1992. ISBN 0023404841 2. Tech Briefs for Microprocessor Systems Elec 67 & 67L. John Heneise, MSAC Walnut, CA. Out of print (source: https://www.amazon.com/Instruments-MT-80Z-Fox-Z80-Trainer/dp/B011IOV6A4/ref=cm_cr_arp_d_pdt_img_top?ie=UTF8).

