$info=mwcbaseb
$mame
0.161 [hap, Kevin Horton]

World Championship Baseball, Mattel Electronics, 1980

This game looks like it was very well taken care of. The box is faded around the edges and corners but in good shape, comes with original inserts and instructions. Both the clear control pad covers are still in great condition, unscratched with no cracks (which we usually don't see on these). I think this was the last VFD game model Mattel made. It's a lot more advanced than other electronic baseball games, probably on par with Coleco's Head to Head Baseball but baseball is one of those games whose beauty is hard to reproduce electronically (source: http://herculesworkshop.com/cgi-bin/p/awtp-product.cgi?d=hercules-workshop&item=71476).

