$info=my1stddr
$mame
0.206 [Sean Riddle]

My First Dance Dance Revolution (US), Konami, 2006

Gamers without a console that want to enjoy a dancing sim can get their groove on with My First Dance Dance Revolution. By plugging directly into the television, players are presented with a variety of characters, modes, and songs to choose from. Gamers can begin in 2-step mode and work up to 4-step mode with five different characters including Noel, Nick, Emma, Zack, and Izora. Players may also take a break from their normal dance routine and test their stepping skills in several mini-games (source: https://www.ebay.com/p/56268228).

