Samsung NUON Enhanced DVD Player / DVD-N501, Samsung, 2001

The Samsung DVD player is enhanced with NUON technology, which adds additional features to the normal player. It can play certain video games also enhanced with NUON technology, MP3 music files, and provides extra DVD features such as zooming.There were initial plans to include Internet capability in the next generation of these enhanced DVD players, but they were never developed. Only eight games were ever released for the system (source: https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/video-game-console-dvd-player-samsung-nuon-enhanced-dvd-player-dvd-n501-samsung-electronics-co-ltd/egHSh9eaNRYHHw).

