NeXTcube, Next Software Inc, 1990

The NeXTcube is a high-end workstation computer developed, manufactured, and sold by NeXT from 1990 until 1993. It superseded the original NeXT Computer workstation and is housed in a similar cube-shaped magnesium enclosure. The workstation runs the NeXTSTEP operating system and was launched with a US$7,995 list price (source: https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NeXTcube) .

