- 0.156: Al Kossow and Barry Rodewald added skeleton driver of 'Convergent Technologies NGEN CP-001' system. Mapped DMA controller, no idea what DMA channels map to what devices, yet. Mapped i8254, connected channel 2 to the serial clock, added 'RS232 ports and connected them to the uPD7201.Added basic display, and other little bits of WIP. Hooked up CRTC and adjusted CRTC clock, resolution and refresh rate are set to expected values.

