$info=ngpc
$mame
0.131 [Wilbert Pol]

NeoGeo Pocket Color, SNK, 1999

The Neo Geo Pocket Color (shortened NGPC), is a 16-bit colour handheld video game console manufactured by SNK. It is a successor to SNK's monochrome Neo Geo Pocket handheld which debuted in 1998 in Japan. The Neo Geo Pocket Color was released on March 16, 1999 in Japan, August 6, 1999 in North America, and some time in 1999 in Europe (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neo_Geo_Pocket_Color).

