$info=nsnova
$mame
0.227 [hap, Berger]

Super Nova (Novag, set 1), Novag Industries / Intelligent Heuristic Programming, 1990

The Super Nova can be integrated into the Novag Super System via the serial RS 232 interface. PC interface, external chessboard, printer and connection to a TV set via the distributor box is possible. The Super Nova has an interesting peculiarity (or program error): After a cold start and also after switching it off / on, it always answers 1.d4 with 1.- b5 and 1.e4 with 1.- Nc6. If you leave him white, he only plays 1.g3 (source, traslated from German: https://www.schach-computer.info/wiki/index.php/Novag_Super_Nova).

