M203 motherboard, Olivetti, 199?

Motherboard 286 model M203 installed on Olivetti M290S. It has 1MB of RAM soldered to the card expandable up to 5MB through the four 30-pin SIMM Slots. The integrated 16MHz CPU is PLCC type. This motherboard was innovative for the time (1989) as for the first time it featured all the components on the board, an idea that was also taken up by other manufacturers a few years later (source, traslated from Italian: https://www.pcrebuilding.altervista.org/401/373/MOTHERBOARD/286/Olivetti+M203+(M290S)+286.html).

