0.128 [Miodrag Milanović]

Ondra, Tesla, 1989

Ondra was developed in Elstroji and put in charge of production Tesla Liberec and later. The main objective was to develop a cheap and reliable' system. The heart of the processor Ondra U880 (German version Z80). After equipped with 64 kB of RAM and 4 KB ROM could display 320 x 255 pixels point. Allows users connect to even peripherals / tape recorder, parallel printer and joystick. Ondra him UHF output, but only Video output and UHF modulator (source, traslated from czech: Ondrahttp://osmi.tarbik.com/cssr/ondra.html).

