$info=orb240
$mame
0.288 [TeamEurope]

Orb Gaming 240-in-1 Handheld, Orb Gaming, 201?

The Orb Gaming 240-in-1 Handheld (also marketed by its parent brand, Thumbs Up!) is an ultra-lightweight and affordable handheld console designed to replicate the visual experience of classic 8-bit games. This device falls into the category of so-called hardware Famiclones. Its internal motherboard emulates an architecture derived from Nintendo’s NES/Famicom. The 240 games loaded into memory come largely from the catalog of developers specializing in bootlegs and native plug-and-play software, such as the well-known Chinese company Nice Code.

