$info=paccon
$mame
0.220 [Sean Riddle, David Haywood]

Pac-Man Connect & Play (Feb 14 2012 10:46:23), Bandai, 2012

Bandai's Pac-Man Connect and Play brings back your favorite classic video games right to your television! The battery-operated old school joystick connects right to your TV, for instant gaming fun. This clever collection features 12 classic games, including: Pac-Man, Pac-Man Plus, Bosgonian, Galaxian, Mappy, Super Pac-Man, Galaga, Dig Dug, Rally X, Pacand Pal, Xeviou and the all new game Pac-Man 256. For the first time Bandai offers fans the chance to play coveted level 256. The original game was meant to be never ending but a bug in the program ended the game at level 255. The bottom of the screen is corrupt with random symbols making it impossible to eat enough dots to beat the level. 256 Challenge lets you begin where this left off. The unique Pac-Man shaped controller is designed like the original game controllers. The Store and Play feature allows real Pac-Man fanatics to store the cord in the Pac-man shaped controller to display Pac-Man too (source: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Pac-man-Connect-Play-Electronic-games/dp/B008MYL0SW).

