$info=pc1000
$mame
0.155 [Porchy]

PreComputer 1000, Video Technology, 1988

It's the 3-in-1 computer teacher that teaches touch typing, basic computer programming, and over 1000 facts. Your pre-teen will get the feel of a real computer, without feeling the intimidation. They will get many activities in one machine. PreComputer 1000 tutors in BASIC programming. It includes five math activtiies, has a built-in calculator with memory, as well as a 20-character dot matrix display screen (source: http://clickamericana.com/media/advertisements/introducing-the-computer-age-vtech-precomputer-1000-1988).

