PC-6001mkII (Japan), NEC, 1983

The PC 6001 MK II was an improvement over the orginal PC-6001. It was available in two color cases: silver and ivory. The system could work under three different Basic modes: N60 Basic, N60 Extended Basic and N60m Basic, each one offering different text and graphic modes, the maximum being 320x200 with 4 colors. There is a ROM holding 1024 chinese characters (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?c=393).

