NEC PC-9801-119 Keyboard, <unknown>, ????

The NEC PC-9801-119 Keyboard is a keyboard designed specifically for use with the NEC PC-9801 series computers, a popular line of personal computers manufactured by NEC and popularized mainly in Japan during the 1980s and 1990s. The PC-9801-119 is a standard hardware interface (keyboard) for many models in the PC-9801 series, and is a key tool for user input. It was commonly included as part of the system or sold separately as a replacement or add-on component.

