$info=pcjr_graphics
$mame
0.152

IBM PCjr built-in video, <unknown>, ????

DRIVER:
pc/pc_t1t.cpp

DRIVER STATUS:
Emulation: Good
Color: Good
Sound: Good
Graphics: Good
Save State: Unsupported

WIP:
- 0.283: Changed description to 'IBM PCjr built-in video'. Implement device_memory_interface. Fixed horizontal resolution of 640*200 1BPP mode for Tandy 1000. Emulate one more detail of Tandy 1000 CGA compatibility. Use indirect colours so palette registers can be visualised. Improved GGA-compatible 320*200*2 mode emulation for Tandy 1000. Fixed emulation of PCjr high-bandwith video modes with 64K RAM.  * The 64kought now correctly shows bad graphics in these modes when run with 64K RAM. Doing this requires tricking the BIOS into thinking 128K RAM is present. Fixed a rather obvious error in bit manipulation. Fixes bad vertical lines everywhere in Tandy DeskMate 2; also cleaned up various stuff. Fixed a couple of issues with Tandy 1000 CGA compatibility. Fixed 640*480 1BPP mode on IBM PCjr. The "64k ought to be enough" demo now runs all the way through with good graphics and sound as far as I can tell. Emulate mode and addressing control registers properly. This emulates the actual effects of the addressing control and mode registers, rather than trying to recognise commonly used combinations; this also corrects the data path width for the Tandy 1000 EX/SX/HX video hardware. Don't double pixels in 4BPP modes. 160*200*4 and 320*200*4 will show what you'd expect the system information menu rather than showing double the horizontal resolution. Configure kanji ROM, don't do string comparisons on short names. Cleaned up a little. Made the Tandy VIDEO-ARRAY and BIGBLUE chips separate devices; moved character generator ROMs internal to the video chips to the devices, moved graphics decoding into devices with internal ROMs; added a check for disabled side effects on read [Vas Crabb].
- 0.186: Renamed (pcjr_graphics_adapter) to (pcjr_graphics).
- 0.152: Added 'PC Jr Graphics Adapter' device.

ROMSET:
None required.

$end
