$info=pdcm2
$mame
0.279 [TeamEurope]

PDC M2, VideoJet / Conny, 2009

This is a portable gaming console with a built-in display, designed for on-the-go play. It comes with an extensive collection of pre-installed games, primarily retro titles and classic arcade classics, which can be accessed instantly without the need for cartridges or external media. Equipped with physical controls like a joystick and buttons, it delivers a straightforward and immersive gaming experience. Powered by a battery, it’s perfect for hands-free, pocket-sized use—ideal for those seeking nostalgic entertainment in a compact, functional design typical of budget-friendly mini-consoles geared toward retro gaming.

