The Symbol PDT 3100 is the most popular portable data terminal in the bar-code data capture industry. It's engineered for high durability and offers a broad variety of options such as a choice of displays, communications, keypads and bar code scanning. Accessories such as cables, batteries, power supplies, manuals and software disks are sold separately unless stated otherwise above. If you are uncertain about what is included with your purchase, or have any technical or other questions, please contact us before placing your order. We are eager to assist you in making the correct choice. Please note that this product is no longer being manufactured and it's one year warranty is provided by Cybarcode, Inc (source: https://www.amazon.com/Symbol-PDT-3100-Portable-Terminal-PDT-3100-S0464020/dp/B075QZKJLP).

