$info=phc35j
$mame
0.82 [Jirou Kaneda]

PHC-35J / Wavy35 (MSX2+, Japan), Sanyo, 1989

The PHC-35J is the simplest MSX2+ model available. It's the only model that doesn't include a disk drive and one of the 2 MSX2+ machines that lacks a built-in MSX-MUSIC, the other one being the Panasonic FS-A1FX. It has a much simpler motherboard than its brothers (Sanyo WAVY PHC-70FD and Sanyo WAVY PHC-70FD2) (source: http://www.msx.org/wiki/Sanyo_WAVY_PHC-35J).

