$info=phc70fd
$mame
0.82 [Jirou Kaneda]

PHC-70FD / Wavy70FD (MSX2+, Japan), Sanyo, 1988

The Wavy PHC-70FD is basically a WAVY PHC-70FD2 less the second diskdrive. It differs from its sibling, the PHC-70FD2 in that it has a hardware pause key and a Ren-Sha Turbo on the place of the second disk drive. Both PHC-70FD and PHC-70FD2 have a much more elaborated motherboard than the WAVY PHC-35J (source: http://www.msx.org/wiki/Sanyo_WAVY_PHC-70FD).

