$info=phc70fd2
$mame
0.82 [Jirou Kaneda]

PHC-70FD2 / Wavy70FD2 (MSX2+, Japan), Sanyo, 1989

The PHC-70FD2 Wavy is a MSX2+ with 64K of RAM and 128 Kbytes of VRAM. It features two 720kB 3?" disk drives but lacks the Ren-Sha autofire controller and hardware pause button from its sibling the PHC-70FD. The other difference with the PHC-70FD is that it includes a 256kB ROM with both JIS-1 and JIS-2 and an RGB connector (source: http://www.msx.org/wiki/Sanyo_WAVY_PHC-70FD2).

