$info=pp6578
$mame
0.286 [TeamEurope]

TV Games Ping Pong (SH6578 hardware), DaiDaiXing Electronics, 200?

Table tennis-themed TV game console manufactured by DaiDaiXing Electronics (a Chinese OEM brand), powered by SH6578 hardware (an affordable SoC for TV games). Compact design with two analog paddle controllers integrated into the chassis, composite video output for TVs, and power supplied via an external adapter. Includes built-in variations of the classic Pong: single-player/dual-player modes, obstacle-based gameplay, and adjustable speed settings. Monochromatic/minimalist 2D graphics featuring simple sprites, with basic audio generated via a buzzer. No official licenses—unauthorized reproduction of the Atari Pong concept. Intended for discount markets as an entry-level nostalgic entertainment option.

