$info=precur2w
$mame
0.286 [TeamEurope]

Delicious Party PreCure Heart Cure Watch & Heart Fruit Pendant Cover Special Set (Japan), Bandai, 2022

Official Bandai toy set inspired by the anime series "Delicious Party PreCure," featuring the Heart Cure Watch and the Heart Fruit pendant cover. The watch faithfully replicates the protagonists' transformation device, with a colorful case (pink, yellow, pastel green), an adjustable silicone strap, and interactive buttons that emit sounds and LED lights when pressed. The pendant cover depicts the series' magical fruits (apple, orange, grape) with glittery details and a magnetic clasp. Designed for girls aged 5 and up as an accessory for role-playing games and collecting. Officially licensed product by Toei Animation/Bandai, marketed in Japan and Asia from 2022 to 2023 to coincide with the series' broadcast. Includes batteries for sound and light functions; materials are non-toxic and comply with child safety standards.

