0.255 [Nigel Barnes, zedstarr]

HC 100, Psion, 1991

The Psion HC100 & HC110 pack powerful laser bar code scanning technology into a cost-effective, lightweight, pocket- sized terminal. Companies with mobile work forces will find it the perfect fit for many applications and industries, including utility meter reading, sales automation, electronic order entry, parcel delivery,route accounting, inventory maintenance and parts tracking. Built to fit the hand, the HC 100 terminal makes it easy for mobile workers on the go to capture data quickly and accurately. The back lit LCD display and full alpha-numeric keypad make it an easy-to-use favorite with employees and available expansion modules, such as a bar code scanner, modem, or RS-232-C, simply clip in and fit flush inside the case at the top or bottom (source: https://cybarcode.com/psion/data_collection_terminals/portable/batch/psion_hc100).

