HC 110, Psion, 1991

The Psion HC 110 handheld computers is comprised of two base models. Both models have 256K RAM and are constructed of high impact plastic and are highly configurable in memory, software, expansion and peripheral devices. Each machine incorporates two drives for Solid State Disks, a rechargeable NiCd battery module (not included), two expansion slots, loudspeaker and microphone (source: https://cybarcode.com/psion/data_collection_terminals/portable/batch/psion_hc110).

