$info=punij1pk
$mame
0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Punirunes (PUNIRUNZU_MAIN_DICE_V1, pink, Japan), Takara Tomy, 2021

The Punirunes Puni Mint Squishy is an interactive toy shaped like a small, soft, round object, featuring an LCD screen at its center. Designed for children ages 6 and up, it lets kids interact with a cute digital character by inserting their finger into a hole on the side—this action stimulates the character on the screen, which responds with expressive animations and movements. The toy reacts to touch as if it were alive, and it can even "melt" when left alone, creating a heartwarming and engaging experience. It requires 3 AAA batteries and combines the satisfying tactile sensation of a squishy with the magic of a simple yet charming digital world—perfect for anyone who loves nurturing and interacting with virtual creatures in a gentle, fun way.

