PV-2000, Casio, 1983

Also called 'RakuGaki' in Japan, the PV-2000 is a very obscure japanese system released in 1983 at the same time of the PV-1000 gaming' system. These two systems are not compatible with each other, as they have very different architecure. The PV-2000 is closer to MSX systems than to its little brother PV-1000 (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?c=1167&st=1).

