$info=qpet
$mame
0.282 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

Q Pet (2nd version), M&D, 2020

It’s a portable electronic toy inspired by 1990s virtual pets. Featuring a color LCD screen and motion sensors, it allows children to care for a virtual pet through touch, vibrations, and simple interactions. It includes feeding, playing, and grooming functions with audio and visual feedback. Designed for children, it combines tactile technology and digital affection in a compact, rechargeable format.

