$info=qy70
$mame
0.245 [BALATON Zoltan]

QY70 Music Sequencer, Yamaha, 1997

A handheld style sequencer with an XG-compatible tone generator added 'to the sequencing features of the QY700, which was released the previous year.
The 4,167 phrases and 768 patterns cover various genres, which makes creating accompaniment as easy as selecting chords and patterns. Also, the accessory “QY Data Filer?? enables the QY70 to exchange music data with the computer it is linked to (source: https://www.yamaha.com/en/about/innovation/collection/detail/2080/).

