$info=r9751
$mame
0.169 [Brandon Munger]

ROLM 9751 Model 10, ROLM Systems, Inc., 1988

The Model 10 brought the power and applications of the 9751 CBX to small and medium-size business in a compact, cost-effective package. Up to 100 stations could be supported by a single modular cabinet (single shelf)' system. Cabinets two and three each supporting up to 250 stations, could be added 'in an integrated, stackable fashion to bring the Model 10's capacity to 600 stations. The Model 10 is designed to operate in standard office environments. Release 9005 supports the 9751 CBX Model Model 10 with all the single-card interfaces and a full range of applications. The Model 10 has the same data-connectivity capability as the other 9751 CBX models, is fully data compatible, and with the optional Data Front End Processor II(DFE II), became a highly efficient system for voice and data integration. The Model 10 cannot use Cornet hardware (RPDN card); CORNet is a proprietary networking software (an extension of ISDN PRI protocols) for Siemens PBXs and the original 9751-9005 model. Also the cabinet is a different design from the other models (the Model 20 through 70 use the same cabinet design, etc.) (source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ROLM).

DRIVER:
rolm/r9751.cpp

DRIVER STATUS:
Emulation: Preliminary
Color: Good
Sound: Preliminary
Graphics: Good
Save State: Unsupported

SOFTWARE LIST:
r9751.xml

RESOURCES:
Snap, Title and Icon.

WIP:
- 0.203: updates - Disktool is now fully functional: i86: Allow '188 to advance DMA immediately if DRQ is held high when source synchronous DMA is started. Connected SMIOC DMA to 68k CPU and fixed communication. Emulated SCC2698B octal UART and connected to SMIOC. Improved logging [Brandon Munger, Stephen Stair].
- 0.202: BugFIX #07086: [Crash/Freeze] (r9751.cpp) r9751: [debug] Assertion Failed! Expression: m_functions.empty() [Osso].
- 0.194: Added keyboard  input queue and CBX OS stack tracing [Brandon Munger].
- 0.192: Added 'more SMIOC commands - disktool is now able to print startup text [Brandon Munger].
- 0.188: Added 'preliminary SMIOC device with 8237 DMA controllers and RS-232 ports [Brandon Munger].
- 0.187: Added 'more SMIOC registers [Brandon Munger].
- 0.176: Add save state support, document progress and clean up, add PROM version 4.2 [Brandon Munger].
- 0.174: Add CBX 9005.2.79 software in r9751.xml. Fix race condition in PDC' device. Multi disk load now possible [Brandon Munger].
- 0.173: Add more floppy debugging and fix DMA masking [Brandon Munger].
- 0.171: Add more DMA registers for serial and floppy [Brandon Munger].
- 0.170: Clean up, add timer register, and add another system disk set to software list [Brandon Munger].
- 0.169: Brandon Munger added 'ROLM Systems, Inc. ROLM 9751 Model 10' system.

