Play TV Opus (NTSC), Radica / SSD Company LTD, 2000

This is basically the same style of gameplay as Popira, but without the ability to expand the library with cartridges. There are also some extra gameplay mechanics such as Smart Bombs, and Red Ball (a ball you have to avoid)  There's a 'static TV' video effect missing in the menus, but otherwise it seems to work pretty well with my XaviX emulation. Thanks to Sean Riddle for dumping and  Peter Wilhelmsen for sourcing. This was one of the trickier ones to get dumped (source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZLptThAdO7U&t=24s).

