0.225 [David Haywood, Sean Riddle]

Out Run 2019 (Radica Plug & Play, UK), Radica / Sega, 2004

The most successful driving game ever takes a little trip to the future in this follow-up to OUTRUN. Going 200 mph means you're holding up traffic in this futuristic take on high-speed racing. See if you have what it takes to roll with the elite speed demons across 25 different routes and five stunning levels. You'll see detailed cities, snow-capped peaks, the expanses of the desert, and even some ancient ruins along your journey. Equipped with turbo boosts, a detailed readout, and your best strategy, you'll experience 360-degree spins, brutal wipeouts, deadly flips, speed ramps, and more. Think you've got what it takes to outrun the fastest futuristic vehicles ever? (source: https://www.ign.com/games/outrun-2019).

