$info=rc2014zedp
$mame
0.244 [Miodrag Milanović]

RC2014 Zed Pro, RFC2795 Ltd, 2018

The RC2014 Zed Pro RomWBW Z80 Kit is a modular computer with a 12 slot enhanced bus backplane. It has a Z80 CPU running at 7.3728MHz, 512k ROM, 512k RAM and communicates over serial at 115,200bps via a Zilog SIO/2 UART. It runs Z-System or CP/M 2.2 operating system from ROM and can use either compact flash or IDE hard disc storage. The backplane allows expansion modules such as official RC2014 Modules or a selection of 3rd party “Designed for RC2014? modules. The design is simple, and the standard 0.1?? pitch headers encourages building your own add-ons. The RC2014 Zed consists of the same modules, but supplied with an 8 slot standard bus backplane (source: https://z80kits.com/shop/rc2014-zed-pro/).

DRIVER:
homebrew/rc2014.cpp

