Retro Arcade Game Controller (150-in-1) (set 2), Red5, 201?

These are a pair of wireless controllers inspired by the style of classic arcade machines, designed to bring the arcade experience straight to your home. Each controller features an 8-way joystick and ergonomic, responsive classic buttons—perfect for retro gaming. Compatible with consoles and PCs (often via the included USB receiver)—they let you play together with up to two players across a wide selection of pre-installed titles—typically around 150 vintage games—that range from shooters and platformers to puzzles. Ideal for gaming nostalgia enthusiasts, family multiplayer nights, or fun gatherings with friends, these controllers boast a durable design and offer an instant plug-and-play experience.

