$info=retror30
$mame
0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Retro Racer (30-in-1), Orb Gaming, 2021

It’s a mini portable arcade cabinet featuring a design inspired by classic arcade games, crafted from durable, vibrant plastic. Measuring just a few dozen centimeters, it faithfully captures the iconic style of 1980s and '90s arcades: complete with a built-in LCD screen, a steering wheel on the left side, red buttons, and a digital display. The device comes preloaded with 30 games—primarily racing and action titles—easily accessible directly from the menu. It runs on batteries (typically AAA) and requires no external connections—it’s ready to play right out of the box. Perfect as a toy or a nostalgic gadget for both kids and adults who love retro gaming, this compact yet authentic experience makes it an ideal choice for collectors or as a thoughtful gift. Launched around 2021, it boasts a modern yet retro-inspired design, often sought after as a collectible item or a great present.

