$info=s10fake
$mame
0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

S10 Handheld Game Console (520-in-1, fake entries), <unknown>, 202?

This is an affordable handheld console featuring a color LCD screen and a compact design, promising hundreds of pre-installed games—often advertised as "520-in-1." In reality, many titles are duplicates, rebranded versions, or minor variations of the same games, resulting in an inflated ("fake entries") game list. The hardware is basic, with directional controls and front-facing buttons, making it ideal for a simple, nostalgic gaming experience. It doesn’t support downloads or expansions, and most of the games are either clones or simplified versions of classic retro titles. Designed for casual users or children, it delivers immediate but limited fun, often accompanied by rough-quality audio, video, and gameplay. It runs on batteries or via USB and is typically marketed as a low-cost gadget or budget-friendly gift.

DRIVER:
nintendo/nes_vt369_vtunknown.cpp

