$info=s2000
$mame
0.283 [R. Belmont]

S2000, Akai, 1993

Professional sampler released in 1993, featuring a 16-bit architecture and support for up to 32 MB of sample memory (expandable). It offers two slots for 3.5" floppy disks for loading and saving sounds, a full MIDI interface, and balanced audio connectivity. Designed for studio producers and musicians, it combines high audio quality, flexibility in sample manipulation, and an extensive set of editing tools—including advanced filters, envelopes, and loop modes.

