A Russian clone by Sergey Zonov (author of Leningrad 48k) made by Zonov and Co. In 1994 it came with 256K of memory (exandable to 2M), a 5?" drive, serial and parallel ports and full size keyboard. It also features an integrated "Shadow Service Monitor". It can also run CP/M. The ROM size may vary from 64K to 512K (source: http://www.interface1.net/zx/clones/scorpion.html).

