$info=scv
$mame
0.136 [Wilbert Pol]

Super Cassette Vision, Epoch, 1984

Successor of the Cassette Vision (1981) and Cassette Vision Jr (1983), units that never hit the european market, the Super Cassette Vision system was an unsuccessfull competitor of the Nintendo Famicom in Japan. In France, on the other hand, Yeno had the opportunity to sell a few thousands of units before the beginning of the marketing of the NES (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?c=844&st=2).

