$info=sega315_5124
$mame
0.149u1

Sega 315-5124 SMS1 VDP, <unknown>, ????

DRIVER:
devices/video/315_5124.cpp

DRIVER STATUS:
Emulation: Good
Color: Good
Sound: Good
Graphics: Good
Save State: Unsupported

WIP:
- 0.233: Fix color in SMS1 VDP(315-5124). Add hardware notes (#7855) [cam900].
- 0.226: Improved behavior of registers 03 and 04 in mode 4, and disabled sprites in mode 1 [Enik Land].
- 0.212: Adjusted horizontal screen positions based on new research [Enik Land, Charles MacDonald].
- 0.201: Fixed off-by-one bug in 315-5124/315-5313 sprite zoom limit. Fixed 315-5214 tile/line numbers in leftmost column. Avoid flagging sprite collisions twice on the same line for 315-5313 [Enik Land].
- 0.200: Updates and improvements: Renamed Game Gear VDP to 315-5377 to match the maintenance manual. Added a device to support behaviour specific to the 315-5313 in mode 4. Made 315-5377 (Game Gear) and 315-5212 (Mega Drive) derive from 315-5256 (SMS2) rather than 314-5124 (SMS1). Improved timing behaviour (verified with Flubba's VDP Test for 315-5313 in mode 4). Emulated sprite status register bits indicating first sprite that overflows. Implemented sprite zoom limit for 315-5124/315-5313. Fixed incorrect scrolling exhibited in Charles' scrolling test. Improved color of leftmost column in mode 4 when fine scroll is applied. Implemented display mode 1 (text) and mode 3 (multicolor) [Enik Land].
- 0.186: Changed description to 'Sega 315-5124 SMS1 VDP'.
- 0.149u1: Added 'Sega 315-5124 VDP' device.

ROMSET:
None required.

$end
