Sega CD 2 (USA, NTSC), Sega, 1993

This SEGA CD was a drastic change to the original design, brought out with the remodel of the SEGA Genesis. Together the Genesis 2 and SEGA CD 2 made a nice looking side-by-side' system. And while I prefer the look of the original, these two together are just as nice looking in their own way. The SEGA 32X also sits nicely on this set-up (source: http://www.gametrog.com/GAMETROG/SEGA_CD_Model_1_2_Information_Specs.html).

