$info=segaptdx
$mame
0.286 [TeamEurope]

Mocchiri Pet Mocchimaruzu DX, Sega Toys, 2020

Interactive electronic toy Sega Toys "Mocchiri Pet Mocchimaruzu DX," an enhanced version of the Mocchiri Pet line launched in Japan in the early 2000s. Featuring a soft, plush-like design with a rounded body and large eyes, it’s crafted from soft fabric and incorporates built-in touch sensors. The toy responds to caresses and pressure with cute sounds (animal vocalizations), gentle movements, and LED lighting in its eyes. It includes virtual care features: you need to feed it, clean it, and play with it using buttons on its body; it displays emotional states (happy, sad, hungry) through sounds and reactions. Powered by AA batteries for extended battery life. Designed for children aged 4–10 as an interactive and educational companion to foster empathy and a sense of responsibility. The "DX" version includes additional features compared to the base model, such as more game modes and more varied reactions.

