0.218 [Sean Riddle, David Haywood]

Big Bonus Slots (Senario, Plug and Play), Senario, 2005

Senario's Big Bonus Slots brings home the video slot machine action for a US audience instead, offering 5 machines and a whole bunch of lucky bonus games for your entertainment. The machines all play basically the same, but with an increased credit value for each, meaning that your virtual $1000 will only get you 2 maximum bet spins on the most expensive machine. There are multiple save slots and your bank amount is kept, so you can build up money on one machine to spend it on another. No unlockables here. Main negative of this one is really the music which sounds like somebody took a keyboard, hit some random keys and called it music and this won't be the only time I feel that way about some of Senario's musi (source: https://mamedev.emulab.it/haze/2020/04/09/under-the-surface-part-9/).

