$info=sfzch
$mame
0.62.1 [Anthony Kruize]

Street Fighter Zero (CPS Changer, Japan 951020), Capcom, 1995

A port for Capcom's CPS Changer was also released as a mail order release in 1996 in Japan. This version is identical to the arcade version, but features a different soundtrack with less sound effects because the CPS Changer is based on the CPS arcade board whereas Street Fighter Alpha was originally designed for the CPS II (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Street_Fighter_Alpha).

