Sheen Home Video Centre 2001, Sheen, 198?

The Intervision 2001 is one of the many systems 'software-compatible' with the Emerson Arcadia 2001. The Intervision 2001 was marketed at least in Finland and Switzerland. The other systems using the same case & cartridge slot, and thus directly compatible with it, are the Sheen Home Video Centre 2001 (Australia) and the Ormatu Video Spelcomputer 2001 (Netherlands) (source: http://old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?st=1&c=1191).

