Siena (French), Psion, 1996

"Psion Siena (French)" is a language variant of the famous Psion Siena, a portable Personal Digital Assistant (PDA) produced by Psion, a British company known for developing innovative mobile devices in the 1990s. The "French" version indicates that the device was distributed with software and user interface in French, designed specifically for the French-speaking market.

