50 in 1 Arcade Joystick, SilverLit / JungleTac, 200?

The "SilverLit / JungleTac 50-in-1 Arcade Joystick" is a standalone Plug & Play console (designed to connect directly to a TV) that was released in the mid-2000s. This particular product combines SilverLit Electronics' expertise in toy manufacturing with the software development capabilities of Taiwan-based JungleTac, a company specializing in the creation of game engines for ready-to-use integrated chips.

