Kasparov Simultano (ver. C), Saitek / Heuristic Software, 1989

The later version of the SIMULTANO was sold with the upgraded ?C? version ROM. You can tell which version you own by opening the ROM compartment at the back of the chess computer. If the ROM has ?C? marked on it then this is the version that you own. There is probably very little difference in the playing strength of the original version and the ?C? version, but the ?C? version might be a slightly stronger chess program (source: http://www.spacious-mind.com/html/simultano.html).

