$info=sitcom
$mame
0.143u7 [Robbbert]

SITCOM, San Bergmans & Izabella Malcolm, 2002

The 'SITCOM' project was designed to offer an easy to build training computer, for anybody interesting in constructing microprocessor based projects. Designed around the 8085 microprocessor (in my experience the micro. most site enquiries are asking after) all of the other components should be easy to obtain, the largest chip being the ever-popular, easy to program 8255 parallel I/O device (source: http://www.izabella.me.uk/html/sitcom_.html).

