SuperStars (CD jukebox), Sound Leisure, 199?

With the industry change over from CD to digital jukebox technology well established Sound Leisure can now offer a comprehensive range of CD to Digital conversions allowing your CD jukeboxes to benefit from the proven advantages of Sound Leisure's market leading digital technology. Our conversions feature all the great facilities available on a standard Sound Leisure digital Audio Jukebox, including our easy to use customer touch-screen interface and engineers menus, 10 independent BGM timers, plus all the latest chart hits and pre-releases updated via CD ROM. All in all the Sound Leisure conversions are the best way to transform existing CD systems to the latest digital jukebox technology (source: http://www.digital-jukeboxes.com/products_conversions_superstars_digital.htm).

