0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Sumikko Gurashi - Sumikko Atsume (Japan), San-X / Tomy, 2018

It’s a portable electronic toy inspired by the world of Sumikko Gurashi—those adorable characters who love to curl up in cozy little corners. Featuring an LCD screen and simple controls, it lets you "collect" and interact with various Sumikko through mini-games, everyday activities, and virtual care tasks like feeding, cleaning, or decorating their special spaces. Each interaction sparks sweet, animated responses accompanied by kawaii-style sounds and animations. The design is soft, rounded, and vibrantly colored, staying true to the original aesthetic—and includes tactile elements that invite touch and discovery. Designed for kids and collectors alike, it combines relaxation, affection, and light-hearted gamification, creating a comforting, heartwarming experience. Battery-powered, it’s perfect for on-the-go play, bringing moments of endearing charm to every corner of your day.

