0.214 [rfka01]

Mini 286, Snobol, 198?

The Mini 286 main board is a high performance AT compatible main board that provides high speed processing while maintaining full compatibility with the IBM PC/AT main board. The Mini 286 main board are low power consuption, low board space requirements, high reliability, high integration AT chip se system board. Simply stated, you can design a new system or upgrade your existing system with no modifications to existing or available components. In fact, your Mini 286 main board may already have been installed into a complete system by your dealer (source: original manual).

