$info=snread
$mame
0.161 [hap, Sean Riddle, Kevin Horton]

Speak & Read (US), Texas Instruments, 1980

Speak & Read is an electronic learning aid made in 1980, by Texas Instruments. Speak and Read was part of a family of learning toys i.e. "Speak & Math" and "Speak & Spell". Speak & Read helped children from ages four to eight develop and improve their reading comprehension and vocabulary. Speak & Read came with a companion booklet for use with the skill activity modes included in the unit. The toy had a vocabulary of 250 words (source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speak_%26_Read).

