$info=sns_rom_st018
$mame
0.277 [cam900]

SNES Cart (LoROM) + Seta ST018, <unknown>, ????

It is a cartridge for Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) that uses a special hardware configuration: a LoROM mapper and an additional co-processor chip called Seta ST018, manufactured by the Japanese company Seta Corporation . This type of cartridge is associated with specific games, usually developed by Seta itself or in collaboration with Nintendo or other software houses at the time.

