$info=snspellit
$mame
0.165 [hap]

Grillo Parlante (Italy), Texas Instruments / Clementoni, 1983

Nothing else than the Italian speaking version of the Speak & Spell (Type 3) with a different voice. Grillo Parlante was distributed in the 80s like some other Texas Instruments products by Clementoni. Most Grillo Parlante and all Dotto Contaparla on the Italian market seem to be from Clementoni (source: http://www.datamath.org/Speech/GrilloParlante.htm).

