$info=soulbird
$mame
0.279 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger Soul Bird: Animal Kyuushutsu Daisakusen (Japan), Bandai, 2001

This is an interactive electronic toy inspired by the TV series *Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger*, designed for fans of the Super Sentai franchise. The device, shaped like an animal or a symbolic accessory from the series, reproduces original sounds, phrases, and music—and often includes lights and activation mechanisms tied to character transformations or special abilities. By performing actions such as pressing buttons or moving parts of the toy, children can recreate scenes from the show, encouraging role-playing and imaginative play. Designed to promote physical movement and interaction, it combines entertainment with faithful representation of the show's universe, a hallmark of Japanese products aimed at kids.

