$info=speechp
$mame
0.178 [hap, Sean Riddle, Lord Nightmare]

Speech+, Telesensory Systems, Inc., 1976

Speech+ speaking calculator with instructions on cassette. The knob at top right is pulled to turn the calculator on and then acts as a volume control. Pressing the button with the loudspeaker symbol (below the "=" button) makes the calculator speak the number on the display. The switch below this button can be used to switch off the speech system (source: http://www.vintagecalculators.com/html/speech-.html).

