$info=starbuck
$mame
0.288 [TeamEurope]

Starbucks x Subor (OEM Q2, China), Subor, 2022

The "Starbucks x Subor" console (OEM Q2) is a limited-edition standalone handheld console released in China in May 2022 (with reissues and commemorative variants tied to special cards in 2025). The device is the result of a promotional "crossover" collaboration between the famous Starbucks coffee chain and the historic Chinese video game company Subor (known since the 1990s for its classic NES/Famicom hardware clones). From a structural and technical standpoint, the console uses the chassis and components of the budget-friendly Subor Q2 model as its base (OEM).

