Carol Vorderman's Sudoku Plug & Play TV Game (All in 1 / Play Vision), All in 1 Products Ltd / Play Vision, 2005

This game is a fun way to enjoy Sudoku with a friend! First, put in the "starter" numbers from one of the 100 cards using the green disks. Now agree how many one minute turns you will both take and who will start - then off you go. It's a nail biting race to get as many correct numbers in YOUR colour as possible, during the agreed number of turns. Score for every correct number, but beware - wrong numbers are subtracted from your total. The red filter allows for extra clues and lets better players take on less practiced friends (source: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Carol-Vordermans-Sudoku-Board-Game/dp/B000ATLI52).

