$info=svi728
$mame
0.128 [Wilbert Pol, Miodrag Milanović]

SVI-728 (MSX1, International), Spectravideo, 1984

The SV-328 follow up, the 1984/85 SVI-728 where their first fully MSX compatible computer. In late 1984 Spectravideo launched their fully MSX compatible computer, the Spectravideo SVI-728. Spectravideo had then sold over 25.000 computers worldwide. Spectravideo had a fairly good success in Europe and other parts of the world, but their US sales was poor. Some was blaming bad distribution, and limited visibility in the stores. Their financial situation wasn't in good shape either (source: http://www.samdal.com/svhistory.htm).

