$info=swclone
$mame
0.219 [Sean Riddle, David Haywood]

Star Wars: The Clone Wars - Clone Trooper Blaster Game, Hasbro / Tiger Electronics, 2008

Become a member of the Republic Clone trooper army in this TV plug-in game that features multiple missions, 10 game levels and 2 modes of play. Simply grab this blaster and plug it into your TV (not included). Once you receive your mission orders, get ready to shoot or be shot at as you represent the Republic's clone army in this one-person shooter game. Blast your way through strategic ground missions, attack enemies from a swoop bike, defends your base while manning a gunner's turret, and more. Receive communications from Jedi commanders and other popular Star Wars Characters. Story Mode lets you play the game through 10 levels in sequence. Arcade mode lets you go to any level you've already played in Story Mode; so if you are having trouble clearing a level, you can practice it in Arcade Mode. Grab your blaster and join the clone troopers as they battle to save the Republic. Requires 4 AA batteries. For 1 player ages 6 and up. For use with standard glass screen TV only; not for use with projection TV, High definition TV, or plasma TV (source: https://www.amazon.com/Tiger-Star-Wars-Clone-Plug/dp/B00168L19O).

