$info=tak_beyu
$mame
0.279 [David Haywood, Sean Riddle, TeamEurope]

Beyblade Arcade Challenge 5-in-1 (US), Takara / Hasbro / SSD Company LTD, 2003

This is an electronic game set dedicated to the Beyblade universe, combining physical and digital elements for an interactive, challenging experience. It includes a battle arena equipped with sensors and an electronic system that detects hits and tracks scores in real time, along with several pre-set game modes. The set supports up to five Beyblades and allows for head-to-head battles featuring dynamic sound feedback, lights, and animations. Designed for competitive and social play, it encourages skill, strategy, and friendly competition—blending the traditional Beyblade gameplay with modern technology to deliver a more immersive and adrenaline-pumping experience.

