Tamagotchi 4U (Japan), Bandai, 2014

A portable device released in Japan in 2014, representing the fourth generation of the renowned Tamagotchi. It features a color LCD screen, a rounded design, and new social features—including the ability to connect with other Tamagotchis via infrared to exchange items, play together, and grow the virtual community. The device includes new characters, enhanced mini-games, and a more intuitive interface, offering an evolved and interactive digital care experience compared to the classic versions.

