$info=tamaid
$mame
0.283 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

Tamagotchi iD (Japan), Bandai, 2010

A portable device released in Japan in 2010, part of the modern evolution of the famous Tamagotchi. Equipped with a monochromatic LCD screen and an advanced infrared reader, it allows users to connect with other units and special interactive stations to unlock exclusive content, customize their own Tamagotchi, and participate in virtual events. It also introduces the "ID" feature, which records the player's preferences and activities, offering a personalized care experience and enhanced social interaction compared to earlier versions.

