$info=tamameet
$mame
0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Tamagotchi Meets (Japan), Bandai, 2018

It’s a Japanese portable device launched in 2018 that revamps the classic "virtual pet" concept with modern features and connectivity. Equipped with a color screen and a compact design, it lets users raise a customizable digital character, complete with daily life cycles, emotions, and needs to fulfill. The real innovation lies in its ability to connect with other devices of the same type via infrared, enabling players to exchange gifts, socialize their Tamagotchis, or even breed them to create new generations with inherited traits. The device also includes mini-games, virtual gadgets, and a "travel" mode that adjusts the character's behavior based on real-world movements. Designed for both longtime fans and younger generations alike, it blends nostalgia, innovation, and social interaction into an emotionally engaging and immersive experience—typical of the Bandai style.

DRIVER:
handheld/generalplus_gpel31xx.cpp

