Tamagotchi m!x Melody Blue (Japan), Bandai, 2016

A portable device released in Japan in 2016, belonging to the Tamagotchi m!x line. Featuring a vibrant melody-blue color scheme, it incorporates an innovative connection feature via a special cable that allows you to link two units together, unlocking exclusive characters, new mini-games, and cooperative interactions. The device includes a variety of character families, updated graphics, and gameplay mechanics centered around collaboration, delivering a richer social and collectible experience compared to traditional editions.

