Battletoads?is a video game?media franchise?by?Rare?that began with the original?beat 'em up?game?Battletoads?in 1991. Starring three?anthropomorphic?toads?named after skin conditions,?Rash, Zitz, and Pimple, the series was created to rival the?Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles?games series. The original?Battletoads?game for the NES was renowned for its extreme difficulty, but still received a cult following, spawning sequels for various platforms including a?crossover?with the?Double Dragon?series?and a modern reboot after a 25 year gap in releases. In each of the games, the objective is to defeat the toads' nemesis the?Dark Queen?and her army of space mutants. This?LCD game?was released by?Tiger Electronics?in 1991 (source: https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battletoads).

