$info=tcarnavi
$mame
0.218 [Sean Riddle, Peter Wilhelmsen, ShouTime]

Tomica Carnavi Drive (Japan), Tomy / SSD Company LTD, 2003

What a warehouse find! This was produced by Tomy back in 2003. Get your kids started on the road to automotive mastery with this toy steering wheel computer navigation TV game and die-cast model of a Nissan Skyline! Just hook up the wheel to your TV with the supplied jacks, and you're ready to navigate! The little die-cast car can sit on the turntable in front of the wheel, and turns as you turn the wheel. Follow the arrows on the screen for safe and happy navigating. There are seven navigation stages, a look at Tomica World, and three other fun games. Requires four AA batteries, not included. (source: https://www.hlj.com/tomica-car-navi-drive-tkt65056).

