This engineering workstation consists of a main motherboard with a 512Kb expansion memory. It also includes a blank expansion slot and an expansion slot that includes 2 hardcopy interface ports and a SCSI interface. At the top of the back panel there are 2 RS232-C serial ports, one LAN interface and one GPIB interface. Also at the top of the back panel, there is a computer board diagnostic display and some computer board configuration switches. There is a 5.25 inch floppy disk drive on the front panel (source: https://www.computerhistory.org/collections/catalog/102729236).

