0.196 [Julian Lachniet, critor]

TI-73 Explorer (bootleg), Texas Instruments, 20??

Texas Instruments TI-73 Explorer™ Blue graphic calculator converts angles from degrees to radians and allows fraction/decimal conversions while offers English and metric conversions.
Texas Instruments TI-73 Explorer™ Blue graphic calculator provides 4 x graphics functions simultaneously and stacked fractions. Calculator features a display which indicates when fraction can be simplified. Display type: LCD. Display screen: 8 line x 16 digit. Power source: 4 x AAA battery. Functions: Fraction, data collection with cbr and cbl 2, data analysis and plotting, constants - developing number patterns, conversions, stacked fractions, English and metric conversions, 4 xgraphs functions simultaneously. Change improper fractions to mixed numbers, simplifies fractions, fraction/decimal conversions, combinations and permutations, random number generator, trigonometry, logs and antilogs. Fixed decimal capability, aos: x and / before + and -. Software functionality: Scrollable home screen, stacked fractions, 4 constant features, English and metric conversions, applications available from TI, sunburst software, and others, more advanced functions accessed through pull-down menus. Hardware features: Large 64 x 96 pixel screen, I/O port for linking and data collection, uses TI-82/83 ViewScreen LCD panel, unit-to-unit link cable included, impact-resistant slide case, built extra-durable for middle school use. Send and receive lists and variables to and from the TI-82, TI-83, TI-83 Plus, TI-84 plus, user-defined list names, stores up to 999 elements, 13 zoom features, function evaluation table, 3 statistical plot set-ups, interactive equation solver. Programming capabilities, display indicates when fraction can be simplified, shows common factor used during simplification, enter your own factor during simplification, simplifies fractions, fraction/decimal conversions, random number generator (source: https://www.staples.com/Texas-Instruments-TI-73-Explorer-Graphic-Calculator-Blue/product_962335).

