$info=tiger108
$mame
0.280 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Spillekonsol Game console - 108-in-1, Zebra AS / Tiger Retail, 201?

This is an affordable plug-and-play console designed to connect directly to your TV via AV or HDMI cable. It comes with 108 preinstalled games—often clones or simplified versions of classic arcade, platform, and puzzle titles—easily selected from a straightforward menu. The built-in (or included) controller features a joystick and basic buttons, boasting an ergonomic yet minimalist design that’s perfect for casual gamers or families. No cartridges, downloads, or complicated setups are required—just plug it in and start playing. Ideal for an instant, low-cost gaming experience, it delivers nostalgic entertainment without demanding advanced technical skills—though its graphics and gameplay are decidedly rudimentary. Typical of the retail market for gaming gadgets, it’s often sold as an inexpensive gift or a fun pastime for kids.

