Moving Music (MM-TV110), TikTokTech Ltd. / 3T Games / Senario, 200?

Moving Music is a plug-and-play TV Music Game. Equipped with a camera and using advanced motion-tracking technology, Moving Music lets kids become an onscreen music star and interact with virtual African drums, Latin congas and a variety of other game objects, all by simply waving their hands and shaking their body. Included are 4 exciting music games encouraging body exercise while making music and playing games. An award winning game: 1) Digital Entertainment Grand Award, Hong Kong Information and Communications Technology (ICT) Awards 2006 2) The Best Computer/TV Entertainment Software, The 4th Hong Kong Digital Entertainment Excellence Awards. Product includes a 1 year warranty. AC adaptor is optional and not included in package (source: https://www.ebay.com/itm/124576352442).

