0.160 [hap, Kevin Horton, Olivier Galibert]

Tron (Tomy), Tomy, 1982

Tomy's Tron, based on the Bally/Midway Tron arcade game (which is based on the Disney movie Tron). Cool game, the entire case is made of a smoked clear plastic so you can see the inside of the game (and it has some large, simulated circuitry in the back, to make it look even cooler) Released by Grandstand in the U.K. (source: http://www.handheldmuseum.com/Tomy/Tron.htm).

