The Roland TR-505 Rhythm Composer was released by Roland, in 1986. It is a drum machine and MIDI sequencer from the same family as the Roland TR-909, TR-808, TR-707, and TR-606. The drum kit includes basic rock drum sounds similar to those of the TR-707, plus a complement of Latin-style drum sounds similar to those of the TR-727 (the Latin version of the TR-707) (source: https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roland_TR-505).

