$info=ttwistvc
$mame
0.230 [Sean Riddle, David Haywood]

Turbo Twist Vocabulator (US), LeapFrog, 2001

The Turbo Twist Vocabulator from Leap Frog is like having your own personal brain trainer. Three game modes provide hours of learning and fun, including Word Wizard (matching words to definitions), Jumble Tumble (unscrambling letters to find the word) and Root Rodeo (match a definition using prefixes, root words and suffixes). Vocabulator also tracks "Brain Cell" points and "Treasure Gems" earned. Endorsed by educational experts, the Vocabulator is fun, fast-paced and can be continuously updated by downloading new words from the Never-Ending Mind Station (sold separately) (source: https://www.amazon.com/LeapFrog-Vocabulator-Compatible-Never-Ending-Mindstation/dp/B00005BYQF).

