This is a retro handheld console with a built-in display, featuring an extensive collection of 240 pre-installed games—primarily titles inspired by classic arcade hits and early-generation console classics. Designed for instant play, it comes equipped with physical controls like a joystick and buttons, and operates independently without the need for a TV or external connections. Powered by either battery or USB, it delivers on-the-go entertainment in a design that pays homage to the video games of the '80s and '90s. Targeting retro gaming enthusiasts, this device blends nostalgia with convenience in a pocket-sized format—perfect for anyone seeking a simple, no-fuss gaming experience.

