- 0.208: Made Read ID return command if execution phase is reached but ID is not found [AmatCoder]. Changed ND flag behaviour to fix Speedlock copy protection regression [Michael Zapf].
- 0.201: Discard write FIFO data pushed when write command fails to find sector [Michael Zapf].
- 0.199: Clear ST1.ND on ID scan failure, implemented head load delay, and improved logging [Michael Zapf].
- 0.190: Added support for i82072 including sense interrupt status logic and motor on/off logic [Patrick Mackinlay].
- 0.186: Changed description to 'NEC uPD765B FDC'.
- 0.184: Added 'UPD765B' device.

ROMSET:
None required.

$end
