$info=urban240
$mame
0.288 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Mini Arcade Machine 240-in-1 (translucent case), Urban Outfitters, 201?

The "Urban Outfitters Mini Arcade Machine 240-in-1 (translucent case)" is a standalone tabletop micro-arcade cabinet distributed as an exclusive edition by the well-known clothing and lifestyle chain Urban Outfitters. The device falls into the category of nostalgic desk gadgets. Its unique aesthetic lies entirely in the protective casing, which replaces the classic colorful decals with transparent (see-through) plastic that reveals the internal circuits and electronic components.

