DSP563xx unit tests, MAME, 2025

Software test suite released in 2025 to validate the emulation of the DSP563xx core within MAME. Designed to verify the accuracy, stability, and compatibility of DSP implementations across various arcade games, it supports the development of faithful emulators through automated comparisons with real hardware behavior.

