$info=vclock3
$mame
0.254 [hap, Sean Riddle]

VoxClock 3, Tandy Corporation, 1984

Your VoxClock 3 is a talking clock with two alarms that announces the time and date at the touch of a button. The clock can be programmed to announce the time or ring at quarter-hour, half-hour and hourly intervals. It is the latest development in modern timekeeping and state-of-the-art electronics. We recommend that you read the instructions in this manual carefully so that you will know how to operate your VoxClock "3 properly. You will also become familiar with the many special functions that your VoxClock 3 offers you (source: Introduduction of Owner's Manual).

