VG-8230 (MSX2, Netherlands), Philips, 1986

he VG 8230 is an MSX-2 computer built by Philips. It has 64 KB RAM, 128 KB VRAM, and a 360 KB 3?" Floppy disk drive built-in. Unlike some of their other MSX-2 class computers, the VG 8230 has no memory mapper in its RAM (source: http://computer.wikia.com/wiki/Philips_VG_8230).

