VG Pocket Caplet Fast Acting 35-in-1, Performance Designed Products (licensed by Taito / Data East) / JungleTac, 2006

The VG Pocket Caplet is a 16-bit handheld manufactured by JungleTac and distributed by Performance Designed Products. The VG Pocket Caplet's graphics are considered an improvement over those of the earlier VG Pocket models, with a very bright 2.5" backlit 320×240 TFT display (the package claims its resolution is 960×240, counting the RGB triads to make 3× the number of pixels). The unit has a separate "starter kit" that includes a carrying case and an AV cable unique to the' system. The VG Pocket Caplet comes in four colors: blue, silver, red, or orange; and is powered by three AAA batteries (source: https://bootleggames.fandom.com/wiki/VG_Pocket_Caplet).

