- 0.283: Layout for Access Virus Rack XL (#14538). Layout for Access Virus Rack (Ver. T) (#14542). Layout for Access Virus Classic (#14545). Layout for Access Virus C (#14528). Control Panel LEDs (#14469). Control Panel LEDs; fix glitch on CPanel LEDs; simplify a bit the logic for controling CPanel LEDs. Add internal layout for Access Virus A / Declare inputs for other virus synths / Misc. improvements to the driver (#14502). Analog input knobs for Virus A & B (#14461). CPanel buttons for Virus A & B (#14454). Hookup LCD to port 1 bits (#14430). RAM banking + small fix to knob assignment + knob maxstate=127 on .lay file (#14482)  [Felipe Corrêa da Silva Sanches]. Configure PWM_DISPLAY device just to stop emulation from crashing [AJR].
- 0.189: R. Belmont and absence added 'Access Virus A' system.

