Plug Play TV Games 1 (4-in-1) (VideoJet, France), Conny / VideoJet, 200?

This is a mini console designed to connect directly to your TV, offering instant gameplay without the need for cartridges or discs. It comes with four pre-installed games—typically classic arcade titles or simple retro-style games—that can be enjoyed right after connecting via RF or AV. Featuring either built-in controls or physical joysticks, it’s crafted for casual, family-friendly use, perfect for quick gaming sessions and shared fun. With its compact, functional design, it appeals to those seeking an essential, nostalgic gaming experience—just like the "plug-and-play" systems aimed at home and occasional-use markets.

