$info=vreader
$mame
0.206 [ClawGrip]

V.Reader (US, English, 2011-10-17), VTech, 2011

The V. Reader is a new animated e-reader system for kids aged 3-7 ? it?s like a Kindle for kids. The?V.Reader?is about the size of a paperback book, and it has a clear cover that can be folded all the way back when not in use. There?s also a stylus contained at the bottom of the?V.Reader?for use on the touch screen ? fingers work, too, though! Another feature of the V.Reader that?s pretty exciting is that you can connect it to the computer to download more content (source: https://frugalnovice.com/2010/06/vtech-v-reader-review-giveaway/).

