- 0.207: Added support for later 8 Mword cartridges in vsmile_cart [Ryan Holtz].
- 0.206: Machine promoted to working. Fixed control pad response bytes - first controller is detected and works. Simulate a brief power button press on boot (required for toystor2). Implemented cartridge mirroring (required for techart). Implemented ROM and non-volatile RAM cartridges. De-asserted test point input [Ryan Holtz]. Improved joystick controller emulation [Vas Crabb].
- 0.175: 6 new dumps added 'in vsmile.xml[Team Europe]. Added a few new US dumps in vsmile_cart.xml [Rimsky82].
