$info=vtboxing
$mame
0.211 [ClawGrip]

VRT VT SDK 'Boxing' (Demo for VT03 Pic32), VRT, 200?

Demo software "Boxing" developed for the VRT VT03 development kit based on the PIC32 microcontroller. It showcases 2D graphics capabilities and real-time input on an embedded display, featuring animated boxer sprites, punch detection, scoring, and round timing. The software leverages the PIC32’s integrated peripherals (timers, DMA, graphics controller) to handle rendering and game logic without an operating system. Provided as an example in the VRT Software Development Kit to illustrate low-level programming, I/O management, and performance optimization on low-cost embedded hardware. Intended for developers to test interactivity, critical timing, and efficient resource utilization on the VT03 platform before developing actual applications.

DRIVER:
nintendo/nes_vt02_vt03.cpp

