$info=vtsndtest
$mame
0.211 [ClawGrip]

VRT VT SDK 'VT03 Sound Test' (Sound Generator FMDemo), VRT, 200?

Demo "VT03 Sound Test" included in the VRT Software Development Kit for the PIC32-based VT03 kit. This audio test function generates tones, sequences, and sound effects via software FM synthesis or integrated hardware synthesis. It allows you to verify the proper functioning of the audio output (DAC, amplifier, jack) and the real-time management of audio buffers. The demo showcases the use of PIC32 peripherals (timers, DMA, PWM/DAC) to play sounds without an operating system, providing examples of frequency modulation, volume control, and duration adjustment. It is provided as a reference for developers implementing audio in embedded applications on the VT03 platform, illustrating C-code optimization and precise synchronization between the CPU and audio peripherals.

