- 0.254: Fix DMA-related regression [AJR].
- 0.177: Improvements: Fixed interrupt handling - boots to DOS now * Fixed keyboard error on POST. Machine promoted from NOT_WORKING status [Curt Coder].
- 0.149: Use medium resolution video controller by default [Curt Coder].
- 0.148: Fixed floppy [Curt Coder].
- 0.147u4: Added 'some new dumps from Don Maslin's archive [Kaylee].
- 0.146u1: Emulated the medium resolution video controller. Driver now boots from floppy [Curt Coder].
- 0.144u7: Anna Wu added skeleton driver of 'Wang Professional Computer' system.

ROMSET:
