$info=wantgman
$mame
0.243 [hap, Kevin Horton]

Wanted G-Man, Actronics / Hanzawa, 1982

This is another rare Actronics game, basically a Donkey Kong clone. Two levels- Level 1 is just getting to the top to rescue the girl while jumping over the dynamite thrown by the Kidnapper. Level 2 is like Rivets on Donkey Kong- you have to walk over the red lines to remove them, and then the Kidnapper falls. An interesting thing about this game is that whenever you finish a level, it randomly generates a bonus score for you. I've seen 002 up to something in the 800's so far (source: https://www.handheldmuseum.com/Actronics/WantedGMan.htm).

DRIVER:
