0.261 [TeamEurope, David Haywood]

Motorcycle 30-in-1, WinFun / JungleTac, 200?

The WinFun / JungleTac Motorcycle 30-in-1 is an inexpensive portable motorcycle-shaped console , manufactured by Chinese companies such as WinFun or JungleTac , known for producing retro-style devices with preinstalled games. This type of console belongs to the category of so-called "retro mini game systems" , that is, inexpensive devices that repurpose dozens of classic games from the 1980s and 1990s, but do not have official licenses for the included titles. They are often sold as gadgets or toys.

