0.192 [Robbbert]

WY-30+ (v1.8), Wyse Technology, 1992

The compact, streamlined Wyse 30+ (WY-30+) is the most affordable Wyse terminal, yet it delivers a surprising selection of functions and features: a flat 14-inch screen white, green or amber phosphors, a crisp 80-column display, multiple ASCII emulations, and 41 user-programmable functions for exceptional versatility. The reliable mechanical-switch keyboard provides the superb Wyse "touch and feel" that has become a favorite in the industry. Even the housing combines sleek form with straightforward function: it's only a matter of seconds to open the case for interior access. And, for further ergonomic flexibility, Wyse offers an optional tilt-and-swivel base (source: https://www.vecmar.com/products/productpage.asp?pid=570).

