WY-65 (v2.1), Wyse Technology, 1996

The WY-65 contains the most complete personality array of any Wyse terminal. Besides IBM 3151 compatibility for RS6000 applications, the WY-65 also supports the industry- standard Wyse WY-60 personality, along with other popular modes-such as DEC VT320 and UNIX Console. The WY-65 is ideal for today's multi-host environments, running a variety of operating systems such as AIX, XENIX, UNIX, PICK and multiuser DOS (source: https://www.vecmar.com/products/productpage.asp?pid=1914-Wyse_65_Terminal).

