Feels like you're really out on the lake! XaviX is a unique wireless system that allows for building real skills and works with your body's natural movements. It uses any tv, a XaviX Port?, and a XaviX application cartridge. It is easy to set up and use. No special training is needed. XaviX improves BMR, coordination, balance, strength, agility, cardio, reflexes and more! XaviX Fishing features 5 tournaments to choose from with 3 levels of difficulty, as well as free fishing mode that allows players to enjoy fishing at their own pace. Cast any way you like—overhand, from the side or underhand. Includes XaviX Bass FISHING cartridge, and wireless rod with reel and wrist strap (source: https://www.flaghouse.com/shop.axd/ProductDetails?edp_no=76966).

