0.206 [Sean Riddle, Peter Wilhelmsen]

XaviX Bowling (XaviXPORT), SSD Company LTD, 2004

XaviX BOWLING uses Optical Sensors to detect the speed and direction of your swing. The ball on screen rolls in the direction you point and with the speed of your swing. The Bowling Ball includes Wrist Strap with Adjuster. Features & Modes: Step into the action and up to the lane like never before. With the XaviX System Cartridge and wireless bowling ball, it's just like you're in the bowling alley. Regular Game: For up to 4 people. You can select from 8 preset bowlers with different characteristics or create your own Customized bowler by changing names, and more. Tournament Mode: For up to 8 people. You can bowl with up to 7 of your friends and family members to see who takes home 1st place honors. Experience the thrills and pressure of the competition, but don't forget this is a friendly challenge. Challenge Games: There are 3 modes you can choose from, all 3 of these modes will improve your Speed, Accuracy, and Hand-Eye Coordination (source: https://www.flaghouse.com/shop.axd/ProductDetails?edp_no=75438).

