The Apricot XEN-S Series of personal computers and workstations has been designed to bring 32-bit performance within the price range of conventional 286-based systems. All XEN-S models feature full IBM AT-compatibility and use the Intel 386SX Microprocessor - a full 32-bit processor that has made the enhanced speed and multi-tasking capabilities of 386 architecture available at much lower cost than ever before (source: original Apricot brochure).

