$info=yis303
$mame
0.128 [Wilbert Pol, Miodrag Milanović]

YIS303 (MSX1, Japan), Yamaha, 1984

This Yamaha computer is specialised in music and sound production. In fact it is a low range MSX 1 computer, but if you bought the special Yamaha synthesizer and piano keyboard, then you had a real synthesizer with a sound quality really suprising for that time, and the ability to change or create you own sounds. The YIS-303 is in fact the same computer as the Yamaha CX5, but it has not got the SKW-01 Sound Module built-in (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?st=1&c=440).

