$info=yis503
$mame
0.128 [Wilbert Pol, Miodrag Milanović]

YIS503 (MSX1, Japan), Yamaha, 1984

This Yamaha computer is specialised in music and sound production. In fact it is a classic MSX 1, but if you bought the special Yamaha synthesizer and piano keyboard, then it was clearly different. You got 48 pre-recorded sounds with a quality really surprising for that time, and as it is real synth, you could change or create you own sounds. The YIS-503 is in fact the same computer as the Yamaha CX5M, but it has not got the SFG-01 Sound Module and MIDI interface integrated (source: http://www.old-computers.com/museum/computer.asp?c=439).

