0.282 [David Haywood, TeamEurope]

Xingzuo Dianzi Chongwu Ji, Yule Yuan, 2022

It’s a portable electronic toy released in 2022, inspired by virtual pets. Featuring a color LCD screen and tactile sensors, it allows children to care for a virtual pet through feeding, play, and simple interactions. It includes sounds, lights, and mini-games with emotional feedback based on the care received. Battery-powered, it combines entertainment, playful responsibility, and sensory stimulation in a compact, colorful design.

