Zone Fusion, Ultimate Products / Jungle's Soft, 200?

Soft rug for children produced by Ultimate Products under the brand "Jungle," marketed in the 2000s. Padded fabric surface with a jungle-themed print (animals, foliage), designed as a safe play area for infants and young children. "Zoned" structure with differentiated padding for sitting and play activities, featuring raised edges to define the play space. Practical, washable design intended for home use as a play rug or floor activity mat. This is not an electronic device but rather a textile product for early childhood.

