Zone Kids Fit (18-in-1), Ultimate Products Ltd. / Waixing, 200?

Console TV game plug-and-play economical "Zone Kids Fit" (18-in-1), distributed by Ultimate Products Ltd. (UK) and manufactured by Waixing (Chinese OEM). Compact design with built-in controller or footpad for light physical activities (jumping, stepping). Includes 18 simplified fitness/sports-themed mini-games (running, aerobics, dancing) featuring basic 2D graphics and scores based on motion detected by rudimentary sensors. Composite/PAL video output for European TVs; power supplied via an external adapter. Intended for children aged 5–12 as an entry-level physical entertainment option for discount markets.

