$info=abc1600.cpp
$drv
0.140 [Curt Coder]

WIP:
- 0.288: Fixed video register mirroring [Curt Coder].
- 0.287: Refactor the MAC into a 68008 MMU; fix SASI callback [Curt Coder].
- 0.253: Correct name and year in 'abc1600_flop.xml'. Fixed systest1600 binary floppy image and added source floppy image in 'abc1600_flop.xml' [Curt Coder].
- 0.246: Placed driver in the sub-folder "luxor/".
- 0.242: Partially fixed hard disk DMA. Fix hard disk DMA write. Expects an up counter, and checks that the byte counter value is 0x200 after transferring 0x200 bytes. This is corroborated by the Z-80 DMA Controller Product Specification (February 1980) on page 7 [Curt Coder].
- 0.221: Refactored to use modern Z8530 SCC device, and fixed floppy DMA [Curt Coder].
- 0.162: Fixed invalid data transmitted on first keypress [Curt Coder].
- 0.149: Added Luxor ABC keyboard port slot interface [Curt Coder].
- 0.143u6: Fixed floppy, system now tries to boot from the mount disk [Curt Coder].
- 0.140: Curt Coder added abc1600.cpp driver.

$end
