- 0.195: Added preliminary ABC CAD pointing device/high-resolution graphics add-on device for Luxor ABC 80 [Peter Bortas, Joakim Larsson Edström].
- 0.184: Converted to scanline based rendering, fixed graphics characters, and fixed sound. Genesis Project demos (abcdemo, hiresinv) are now fully working [Curt Coder].
- 0.162: Fixed VSYNC and de-interleaved the ABCDemo diskette. ABCDemo now runs from both cassette and diskette [Curt Coder].
- 0.161: Added ABCDemo floppy and cassette to the software lists [Genesis Project]. Added cassette sound. Emulated the Scandia Metric ABC FD2 floppy controller. Emulated a 16KB RAM card [Curt Coder].
