$info=abc80x.cpp
$drv
0.116 [Curt Coder]

WIP:
- 0.273: Renamed tags to match BASIC device names [Curt Coder].
- 0.266: Added skeleton for 'Luxor Teletex 800' [robcfg, Curt Coder].
- 0.254: Detect interlaced disk images. Split floppy software lists by disk drive type. Fix sector dump floppy image loading. Move ufd631 from 'abc830_flop.xml' to 'abc832_flop.xml' [Curt Coder].
- 0.253: Set hard disk interface to allow softlist loading to slot in the hard disk controller. Add internal keyboard option for abc800m/c. [Curt Coder].
- 0.246: Placed driver in the sub-folder "luxor/".
- 0.241: Enable floppy sounds [Curt Coder].
- 0.221: Fixed abc802 M1 opcode fetch. Fixed memory banking for abc800c, abc800m and abc802. Fixed HR graphics for abc800c and abc800m [Curt Coder].
- 0.197: Implemented option ROM opcode fetch through character RAM [Curt Coder].
- 0.191: Updates: Corrected Turbo Kontroller name to UNI DISK and identified CPU type. Added skeleton for Databoard 4112-23 floppy disk controller. Fixed Luxor 55-10828 "slow" floppy controller board logic [Curt Coder].
- 0.185: Removed the direct update handler [Olivier Galibert].
- 0.183: Fixed sector interleave [Curt Coder].
- 0.177: Fixed ABC-838 disk image cell size [Curt Coder].
- 0.175: Added ROM version 1.05 for the 55-21046 disk controller [Anders Sandahl].
- 0.152: Fixed formatting on the ABC 830/832/834/838 floppy drives. Added support for raw 80KB and 160KB disk images. Added support for raw 1MB 8" disk images. Added support for raw 640KB disk images. Emulated the ABC 850 (10MB), ABC 852 (20MB), and ABC 856 (60MB) hard disk drives. Added slot devices for the ABC 830/832/834/838 floppy disk drives, and the ABC 850/852/856 hard disk drives [Curt Coder].
- 0.149: Added Luxor ABC keyboard port slot interface [Curt Coder].
- 0.146u5: Refactored legacy code, cleaned up keyboard interface, added ABC894 bus expander device, added ABC 55 keyboard for ABC 802 [Curt Coder].
- 0.126: Fixed lower case natural input [Curt Coder].
- 0.124: Updated to use the new MAME MC6845 code [Curt Coder].
- 0.116: Curt Coder added abc80x.cpp driver.

$end
