0.78 [Curt Coder]

WIP:
- 0.283: Coleco Adam floppy disk emulation improvements: Completely reimplement Adam .dsk floppy format, permuting sectors of 720KB and 1.44MB 3.5" formats into (and out of) the correct native interleave; split adam_fdc device into several sets, some now properly supporting 720KB and/or 1.44MB formats; remove the "Doug Slopsema" BIOS for the 320KB FDC variant upon determining it to be a copy of the 320ta BIOS with slight bitrot. Fix build after f69ba6ec9fbb2cfbd3693e1ad084d2f9acf98d17 [AJR].
- 0.282: Simplify VDP interrupt handling (Z80 NMI input is already edge triggered) [AJR].
- 0.263: Made software list descriptions follow conventions [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.247: Use lowercase for descriptive text in descriptions in 'adam_cart.xml', 'adam_cass.xml' and 'adam_flop.xml' [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.246: Placed driver in the sub-folder "coleco/".
- 0.233: Eliminate bus tag macros and legacy lookups; use finder arrays in some places [AJR].
