0.137 [Dirk Best]

WIP:
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "act/".
- 0.207: Added mouse and Winchester controller, and added support for I/O device maps and interrupts to expansion bus [Dirk Best].
- 0.187: Switched to preferred Z80SIO device [Dirk Best].
- 0.182: Use 74153 for the serial clock selector [Dirk Best].
- 0.181: Improvements: Fixed CTS polarity and marked as working - with the SIO fix the system is now very stable. Fixed keyboard error 31, now displays 'System OK'. (z80dart) Only update serial line configuration if it actually changes. Allows the apricot serial port to work correctly. (pit8253) Reading back the count while in the middle of a 16-bit write returns a XOR'ed version of the value written. Fixes apricot error 29 [Dirk Best].
- 0.177: Improvements: Moved expansion bus to its own directory. Created bus interface for the keyboard interface. Made HLE keyboard emulation a bus' device. Use device_buffered_serial_interface and device_matrix_keyboard_interface for the HLE keyboard emulation to reduce duplication and implement a FIFO. Added rtc support to keyboard [Dirk Best].
- 0.163: Use correct wd fdc type and fix floppy motor on, implement gaphics mode, simulate sio irq m1 access. successfully boots from disk now. Add an expansion slot interface and add two RAM expansion cards. This will also be usuable by the apricot f series and portable. Add initial keyboard support [Dirk Best].
- 0.152: BugFIX #05296: [Graphics] All sets in a6809.c, apricot.c, bbc.c,  multi16.c, paso1600.c, victor9k.c: Resolution increase [Robbbert].
- 0.137: Dirk Best added apricot.cpp driver.

