0.124 [Miodrag Milanović]

WIP:
- 0.282: Parallel expansion slot and carts (#14263). Emulate bk0011 hardware and b&w/color video switch (#14198): Improve interrupt handling in K1801VM1 CPU core; miscellaneous bugfixes (keyboard interrupt enable, cassette input). Add simulation of K1801VM1 on-chip timer (#14238). Add simulation of K1801VM1 on-chip timer. Add quickload support (#14246) [Sergey Svishchev].
- 0.271: Moved BK0010 floppy drive controller to a card device, and fixed disk writes. Attach floppy (#12889). cpu/t11: VM1 does not use RMW bus transaction for MOV and MOVB insns (fixes writing to floppy) [Sergey Svishchev].
- 0.269: Improved interrupt handling on 1801VM1, misc fixes (#12646). Allows bus error handlers on BK to deal with interrupt from STOP key (causes a HALT-mode IRQ and triggers access to unmapped region at 177674) [Sergey Svishchev].
- 0.267: Use K1801VM1 CPU and 1801VP1-014 keyboard interface devices [Sergey Svishchev].
- 0.265: Added DAC, QBus and unmapped read/write traps (#12238). Also fixed cassette motor control and improved video output [Sergey Svishchev].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "ussr/".
