WIP:
- 0.269: Demote all .d81 files to not working in 'c65_flop.xml'. Working sprite-background priorities. Implement ROM $C000 view. Basic sprite drawing. Shuffling for VIC bank support. Preps for C64 software support. Move drawing to scanline renderer, add border. Move DMA logic to emu_timer. Implement DMAgic DIR. Basic convert DMAgic to device. Add stub exp cart, add DE-9s. Add remaining base gfxmodes. Add CIA0 irq, fast mode select and base videoram offset. Enough to make it boot in C=64 mode [Angelo Salese].
- 0.268: Fix lambda capture. Misc cleanups. Delete unused header file [Angelo Salese].
