- 0.192: Reordered keys and renamed I/O ports to match system specification. Added caps key and two extra keyboard columns, although only one of them may have made it into hardware. Added support for switching between 40/80 columns with F1 and blink/underline/highlight/reverse attribute. Allow switching between upper case/lower case character ROM with shift+Commodore key [smf].
- 0.148: BugFIX #04874: [Crash/Freeze] (c65.c) c65, c64dx: memory_bank::set_base called NULL base [Fabio Priuli].
