- 0.271: Added fourteen working items to 'coleco_homebrew.xml' [colecovision.dk, colecovision.eu, Inufuto, ArcadeShadow].
- 0.270: Tidied descriptions (avoid abbreviations, etc.) (#12764); cleaned up software descriptions in 'coleco.xml' and 'coleco_homebrew.xml' [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.267: Added eight working items to 'coleco_homebrew.xml' [Inufuto, ArcadeShadow].
- 0.265: Move coleco homebrew titles to their own softlist and fix a few issues. Add missing megacart feature to mariobrs and zombnear so that they actually run when started from the softlist. Add homebrew titles sourced from ColecoVision Addict. Add expansion bus and support for the Super Game Module. This obsoletes PR#10816. Thanks to kmg for the initial implementation [Dirk Best]. Added 34 items (27 working) (#12202) in 'coleco.xml' [ArcadeShadow].
