- 0.255: Fixed LCD segments for ktmntbb [hap, algestam]. Correct release year for some konami handhelds [hap].
- 0.252: BugFIX #07587 [Graphics] (handheld/hh_sm510.cpp) Artwork: Multi-screen layer blending exhibits issues when using BGFX [Ryan Holtz].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "handheld/".
- 0.241: Rescan display for rkosmosa [algestam].
- 0.240: Improved nupogodi LCD screen representation [Milan Galcik, algestam]. Display improvements for nupogodi [algestam]. Put elektronika games in their own list at bottom of driver [hap].
- 0.239: Changed descriptions for Elektronika games to transliterated Russian titles [algestam].
- 0.238: Typo in comment [hap].
- 0.237: Add cheat inputs for trsrescue and trthuball [algestam].
- 0.236: Added cheat inputs for gnw_flagman, gnw_judge and gnw_lion [Milan G., algestam]. Add cheats for gnw_flagman, gnw_judge and gnw_lion [algestam].
- 0.235: Re-scanned display for Elektronika Autoslalom [algestam].
- 0.234: Corrected serial ID for gnw_manholeg in comment [algestam].
- 0.229: Verified that gnw_egg and gnw_mmouse microcontroller programs are identical. Improved gnw_egg display using scanned from unit. Confirmed gnw_mmouse uses microcontroller R mask option [algestam].
- 0.217: Set 16-way flag for Game & Watch games that don't physically prevent contradictory directions being pressed [algestam].
- 0.215: Re-scanned gnw_mmouse display [algestam].
- 0.214: Improved re-created melody ROMs for gnw_bfight and gnw_mbaway [algestam].
- 0.194: Renamed Game & watch ROM sets to be more immediately recognisable [hap].
- 0.188: Artwork updates: Added background vector graphics to gnw_ml102 [ChoccyHobNob]. Improved gnw_mw56 SVG screen and added background graphics [hap, ChoccyHobNob, Tanukichi]. Improved gnw_jr55 LCD segments. [hap, JonasP]. Added background graphics to nupogodi.svg. [Igor, hap]. Added background graphics to gnw_dm53.svg [Olivier Galibert, hap].
- 0.187: Improved Mickey & Donald SVG artwork [Sean Riddle, Roger Coltrane].
- 0.164: hap added hh_sm510.cpp driver.

