$info=hp9825.cpp
$drv
0.203 [F. Ulivi]

WIP:
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "hp/".
- 0.241: Printer output on a screen added, cassette status added. Added a screen showing printer output, and added a cassette present output [F. Ulivi].
- 0.239: Added Shift Lock and reset keys and tape LED. Added support for SHIFT LOCK & RESET, other minor fixes [F. Ulivi].
- 0.206: Added high-level emulation of HP9885 floppy drive, and extended the HPI format to handle single-sided disks [F. Ulivi].
- 0.205: Split I/O subsystem out of hp9845 driver, added I/O slots to hp9825 and added 98032 GPIO module [F. Ulivi].
- 0.204: Added internal expansion ROMs for hp9825b [F. Ulivi].
- 0.203: F. Ulivi added hp9825.cpp driver.

$end
$info=hp9845.cpp
$drv
0.154 [Curt Coder]

WIP:
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "hp/".
- 0.211: Added support for the HP98046 serial I/O module [F. Ulivi].
- 0.205: Split I/O subsystem out of hp9845 driver, added I/O slots to hp9825 and added 98032 GPIO module [F. Ulivi].
- 0.193: Added high-level emulation of internal printer [F. Ulivi].
- 0.189: Refactored handling of HTI images into a dedicated format module, refactored hp9845_tape imgtool module to use HTI format [F. Ulivi].
- 0.186: Added Support for HPI floppy format used for HP-formatted 8" floppy disks [F. Ulivi, A.Kueckes]. Fixed a system freeze when loading memory tester from tape. Display improvements and softkey support: Improved text video of 45C, improved graphic cursors of 45C and 45T, and implemented softkeys for 45C and 45T [F. Ulivi].
- 0.183: Fixed parallel poll logic in PHI. Working support for HP9895 dual floppy drive with MFI image format. Corrected aspect ratio of alpha and graphic video modes using a layout file [F. Ulivi].
- 0.180: Re-implemented 98035 module with a nanoprocessor driver * Now possible to emulate the 98035 RTC module at a low level thanks to firmware ROM dump from Mr. Kueckes * Implemented "nanoprocessor" microcontroller CPU core and disassembler. Implemented HP98034 module (HPIB interface) [F. Ulivi].
- 0.179: Various changes: Moved hp9845b_state class into a separate file * Refactored handling of irq/sts/flg bits to allow for adding I/O slots * Added I/O slots * Implemented HP98035 RTC card [F. Ulivi].
- 0.178: Filter for HP9845 data files added to imgtool * Translates record-based DATA HP9845 to and from text files [F. Ulivi].
- 0.177: Added correct character generator ROMs [F. Ulivi, A.Kueckes].
- 0.173: Added capabilty to load option ROMs [F. Ulivi].
- 0.171: Added tape driver [F. Ulivi].
- 0.154: Curt Coder added hp9845.cpp driver. Added software lists for option ROMs [Curt Coder].

$end
