0.275 [m1macrophage]

WIP:
- 0.286: (linn_linndrum.lay) Implemented rotating knobs and click states. (#14996) [m1macrophage].
- 0.282: Fix rendering of LinnDrum's rounded corner outlines (#14217) [Felipe Corrêa da Silva Sanches].
- 0.281: (linn_linndrum.lay) Adapting to changes in #14113 (#14119) [m1macrophage].
- 0.278: Adapting to the new sound interface (#13642) [m1macrophage].
- 0.276: Mixing, panning and tuning (#13494): Mix and pan sliders work; master volume knob works; tuning knobs and trimmer work. Adjusted knob sensitivity on the layout; corrected relative levels of voices; added output LPF and DC-blocking HPFs; mild refactoring: moved voice setup in strobe_* functions. Made knobs controllable by pointing device (#13433). First pass at audio emulation (#13458): linn/linndrum.cpp: First pass at audio emulation. Promoted to working; remove stray & from tom variation calculation. Emulating hi-hat decay (#13509): Hi-hat decay knob is now working; open and closed hats have different decays; better default tuning for the snare; removed `strobe_` prefix from functions where it was redundant. Made it an argument in a function where it matters [m1macrophage].
