$info=pc6001.cpp
$drv
0.132 [Angelo Salese]

WIP:
- 0.288: Add printer port (#15211) [Devin Acker].
- 0.285: Move pc6001 cartslot mapping to memory map [Angelo Salese]. Note just how bad the MCU dump appears to be [AJR].
- 0.284: Mark MCU as bad dump [AJR]. Add cassette software lists (#14596) [paul75s].
- 0.274: (pc6001_cart.xml) Added Berserkers Front Gaiden 3 Plus - Turning Point [krugman, Marc Roy]. Added two versions of Turpin [Mike Stedman, bsittler, David Silva].
- 0.254: Add MCU dumps for pc6001 and pc6601sr [Mike Stedman].
- 0.251: Fix joystick multiplexing; add port outputs and HSYNC and VSYNC readback. Correct YM2203 clock [AJR].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "nec/".
- 0.237: Major rework of PC-6001mk2SR (#8626). Added a PC-6001 cartridge software list XML, and hooked up to the driver. Fixed a regression bug with machine_reset fn where PC-6001mkII was implicitly overriding its memory model when a cart was inserted, causing being stuck at POST. Improved irq handling and removed a couple kludges, fixing hangs caused by multiple irqs being fired at the same time. Added PC-6601SR "Mr. PC", and improved the specific SR video mode already used by PC-6001mk2SR. Refactored PC-6001mkIISR / PC-6601SR memory model to use address_map_device, allowing BIOS booting and .cas loading in mode 6. Replace AY8910 with YM2203. Add keyboard inputs F1-F10, and fixed the specific irq vector dispatch. Add preliminary FDC internal/external interface. Hooked up PC80S31 to external i/f as a proof of concept. Fixed timer enable (fixes Yakyukyo and Punchball Mario boots), and fixed different timer resolution with PC-6001mk2SR so that cursor blinking happens at the right frequency [Angelo Salese].
- 0.195: Major encapsulation clean-ups [Angelo Salese].
- 0.140: Removed (pc6600sr)' system.
- 0.132: Angelo Salese added pc6001.cpp driver.

$end
$info=pc8001.cpp
$drv
0.135 [Curt Coder]

WIP:
- 0.275: Grant a slot for DIY expansion ROMs [Angelo Salese].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "nec/".
- 0.243: Major groundwork cleanups. Reduce signature name fns. Separate dictionary and CD-ROM later model use into own state machines. Clean input ports a bit. Bulk printf -> logerror. Initial batch of exporting PC8801-31 to a separate' device. Fix configuration mistake for CPU speed. Add base diplocations, massage documentation of ports $30, $31, $40, misc cleanups. Fix mouse cursor jump bugs, remove deprecated PORT_RESET usage. Rework and extend expansion slot descriptions. Add note about extended FH keyboards. Add dip positions for BASIC dips. Blind fix kanji LV2 hookup. Use required_region_ptr for ROM regions, split kanji_lv2 to own one. Move a few notes to XML. Remove unneeded port $33 hookup (should be unmapped on all PC8801 variants). Initial implementation of interrupts using i8214 as base. Fixes at least yojukiko and bishojbg BGMs. Add clock calculation for internal DAC1BIT, add reported V1 revision numbers for each romset. Move OPN/OPNA sound chip mounts to internal model types, add stereo mixing. Add sound irq pending mechanism, particularly needed by Telenet games. Improve irq semantics, connect rxrdy_irq_w signal. Make OPNA a bit less louder, QA checkpoint. Fix broken link, unmapped I/O documentation. Add JMB-X1 map, other minor notes. Start inheriting from base pc8001_base_state, add initial hooks for actual 3301 + i8257 devices. Fix port40_r reading mistake. Fix 24kHz pixel clock. 3301 irq is tied to VRTC not INT. Simplify bitmap 3bpp drawing and add preliminary palette rasters. Misc documentation updates. Add BG Pal handling, honor transparency in all bitmap layers. Better handling of bitmap fills. Carry over attribute fetches between lines when 3301 is in color mode. Implement colorized b&w graphic modes. Cleanup obsolete functions. Add boilerplate code for base irq mechanism. Add expansion card support, with JMB-X1 (partly addresses #8709), PC-8801-23 and PCG-8100 as PoC examples. Promote some romsets to parent. save_item to all variables in state machines. Fixed many issues and refactored code to better align with current standards [Angelo Salese]. Initialized a variable which was causing problems in regression testing and actually save some states [Ivan Vangelista].
- 0.236: Add DMA functions. Add extension setter for 24KHz mode (which will be used by PC-8801 once implementation is merged). Allow to enter into N80 BASIC mode for mk2 machines. Constexpr the XTALs. Fix machine configs inheritance. Move some shared functions to pc8001_base_state [Angelo Salese].
- 0.176: BugFIX #05534 [Crash/Freeze] (pc8001.cpp) All sets in pc8001.cpp: crash after OK [Robbbert].
- 0.135: Curt Coder added pc8001.cpp driver.

$end
