$info=pv1000.cpp
$drv
0.137 [Wilbert Pol]

WIP:
- 0.273: Added sixteen working homebrew cartridges (#12801). Added seventeen working homebrew cartridges (#13093) [Ectoplasm].
- 0.269: Assert BUSRQ during active display (gives more realistic performance). Toggle BUSREQ like hardware does; this slows down games to realistic speeds (#12623). IRQs were broken in a08b1138: now commercial games work again (#12631). Fixed video scan line interrupt generation regression. Fixed I/O port read and interrupt acknowledgement (#12659) [lidnariq]. Fixed I/O read issues. Don't take a tript through the scheduler if matrix IRQ wasn't active. Suppress read side effects for debugger. Fixed input port selection removed by PR #12659. Actually return two bits of joystick input rather than giving spurious interrupt flags [Vas Crabb].
- 0.268: Three tiny changes (#12570). Add support for 'render disable' control. Pixels are distinctly non-square. At least support banking the pattern data over the entire cartridge (although it should be over the entire memory region). Fixed PCG tile banking, implemented video disable bit, and corrected default aspect ratio. Fixed border colors. Corrected screen image position within borders. Borders are on top and bottom (#12548) [lidnariq].
- 0.254: Updated sound emulation based on new research [David Viens].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "casio/".
- 0.149: Modernized the sound device and added save state support [Fabio Priuli].
- 0.137: Wilbert Pol added pv1000.cpp driver.

$end
