0.132 [Mariusz Wojcieszek, Angelo Salese]

WIP:
- 0.288: Implement semidisk battery backed ramdisk card (#15069) [Brian Johnson].
- 0.286: Fix some issues with memory handing (#14920): Update the system memory to use a modern approach to defining the memory layout and banking; update the VRAM to use memory banking as well for its RGB planes; the 2K CMOS SRAM now uses NVRAM to save its contents; mirroring of the SRAM and ROM now behaves as it does on a real QX-10; add save_item calls for the internal state variables [Brian Johnson].
- 0.272: Reverted misguided changes to video zoom handling [Brian Johnson].
- 0.270: Reinstate visible area check for 7220 text [Angelo Salese].
- 0.269: Use copyrozbitmap for (external to 7220) zoom handling. Rectify previous commit. Don't need to check against visible_area in 7220 own code. At least allow it to build [Vas Crabb].
- 0.249: Reworked QX-10 keyboard implementation, fixing multiple issues [Brian Johnson].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "epson/".
- 0.242: Implemented floppy drive spindle motor on timer. Hooked up interval timer interrupt outputs to the interrupt controller [Brian Johnson].
- 0.235: Corrected video RAM size - onlly 128k is present (fixes graphics scrolling) (#8333) [Brian Johnson].
- 0.234: Fixed video RAM address calculation for color mode [Brian Johnson].
- 0.231: Allocate enough video RAM for color mode. Enable floppy drive B motor on motor register writes. Added speaker output [Brian Johnson].
- 0.149: Hook keyboard up to serial controller [Carl].
- 0.132: Mariusz Wojcieszek and Angelo Salese added qx10.cpp driver.

$end
