$info=tsconf.cpp
$drv
0.239 [Andrei I. Holub]

WIP:
- 0.286: Cleaned up inherited unused driver's Configuration (#14798) [holub]. (tsconf.xml) SPG format. Added 29 items (#13122) [HalfElf, holub].
- 0.285: Added missing credits (#14734) [holub].
- 0.284: (spectrum_betadisc_flop.xml) Added 23 working items (#14693) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.281: Added FPGA 100K variant; implemented Copper for it (#14008) [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.278: Added CRAM initialisation, changed initial system RAM fill to 0x00 (#13823). Initial RAM system RAM content is indeterminate, but tested software seems to work better with 0x00 than with 0xff. Enabled memory waits and access cache at 14Mhz (#13840) [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.276: Add onboard media devices before adding slots to make media options less unstable (#13479) [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.274: Added state save (#13210). Improved tiles decoding (#13145). rm palette hack; replace math with bitswap: simplify; restore tile cache [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.271: Document DMA controller clock source [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.270: Refactored code. Replaced Centronics port and COVOX device with a DAC (#12785). Added BIOS upgrade 24.07.28 option and made it the defaut (#12788). Added BIOS upgrade 24.07.28 option and made it the default [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.269: Fixed graphics layer priorities and screen updates (#12647) [Andrei I. Holub].
