$info=zx.cpp
$drv
0.36b15 [Olivier Galibert, Juergen Buchmueller, Krzysztof Strzecha, Robbbert]

WIP:
- 0.285: (zx81_cass.xml) Start converting "usage" info and comments into new "required_ram" and "required_os" info [AJR].
- 0.284: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 13 working items (#14674) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.281: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 19 working items (#14155). Added 29 working items (#14061) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.279: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 19 working items (#13977) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.278: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 36 working items + 1 not working (#13831) [ArcadeShadow]. Add metadata for blitzbal [AJR].
- 0.277: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 21 working items (#13603) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.275: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 19 items (17 working) (#13374) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.274: (zx81_cass.xml) Added 29 items (27 working), and promoted one item to working with usage instructions (#13174) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.273: Add metadata to a few entries [AJR]. Added 24 working items (#12986) [ArcadeShadow].
- 0.265: Fixed direction keys; fixed name of ringo470 [Robbbert].
- 0.246: Driver placed in the sub-folder "sinclair/".
- 0.244: Restore irq length == 32 / border timings [Andrei I. Holub].
- 0.243: Fixed crashes on start in ZX Spectrum clones and NWK-TR games [Vas Crabb].
- 0.192: Fixed ts1000 display and added extra RAM options [Barry Nelson]. Bugfix#06754 [Color/Palette] (zx.cpp) ts1000: The screen on the Timex Sinclair 1000 displays black on cyan and should be black on white and Bugfix#06755: [Core] (zx.cpp) ts1000: The Timex Sinclair 1000 emulation only has the option of having 2k of RAM [star2root].
- 0.168: Start of a hardware-correct rewrite [Olivier Galibert].
- 0.131: Improved natural keyboard support. Removed hacky double mappings for Cursor Keys (and a few others). To access these keys, now you have to either press Shift together with another key, like in the real keyboard, or simply switch to natural keyboard emulation [Fabio Priuli].
- 0.130: Fixed access violation when mounting a .O tape file; implemented cassette save (only .wav is supported); implemented sound; Fixed cassette loading; Added the NTSC/PAL diode; fixed keyboard labels and layouts; Improved video output; improved memory handling; Added notes. Bugs #159, #739, #1057, #1061 [Robbbert].
- 0.126: Removed (aszmic) system.
- 0.122: Fixed TZX block type 0x13. Added Amstrad CPC .cdt support and fixed pause length [Barry Rodewald].
- 0.102: Implemented RAM configuration support [Nate Woods].
- 0.36b15: Juergen Buchmueller added zx.cpp driver.

$end
